<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[491]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refers to specialist care meanwhile offer tr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>anex</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mic a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>id + NSAID</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[492]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> generation endometrial ablation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[493]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider UAE, Myomectomy or hysterectomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[494]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discuss limitations of each.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[495]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pharmacological treatment less effective for fibroids &gt; 3cm</span></p>
