<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[653]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Pre – Treatment Assessment:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[654]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT including inte</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rvention </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>radiologist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[655]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mapping by USG/MRI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[656]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rule out Pregnancy, infection</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[657]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Remove IUD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[658]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Written leaflet + consent</span></p>
