<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[661]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Procedure:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[662]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>conscious sedation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[663]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti-spasmodic+ analgesics</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[664]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vital Monitor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resuscitation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Facilities</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should be available</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[665]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Catheter enters rt </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>femoral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> artery percutaneously. From Femoral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> it goes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> External iliac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>artery and then to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>common iliac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Artry. From common iliac it goes to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>the internal iliac and finally </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to the </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uterine artery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[666]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>embolic agent 300-75</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0micrometer</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[667]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>polyvinyl alcohol is agent of choice</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[668]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 – 5 fr catheter is used.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[669]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>COMPLICATIONS:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[670]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1. Immediate:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[671]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hematoma of Groin</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[672]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombosis, Dissection, Aneurysm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reaction to contrast media </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>non </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tar</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>geted</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> embolization</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2. Early complications:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[678]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    Within 30 days</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[679]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UTI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaginal d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ischarge</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-Self </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>limiting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[681]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post embolization syndrome</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[682]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pain, fever, nausea, Malaise</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[683]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>increased inflammatory </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>markers,  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TLC</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[684]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Self-limiting 10 days - 2 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[685]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Due to release of inflammatory mediators from necrosis of fibroids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[686]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>treatment:</strong></em></span></p>
