<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[955]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>equential combine therapy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> SCT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[956]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>given in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Perimenopause,</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[957]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> estrogen - whole cycle, progesterone- 10-14days</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[958]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ontinuous combined Therapy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CCT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[959]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Given in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Menopause</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[960]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Estrogen and Progesterone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> continuously</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[961]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>B</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>enefits</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[962]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> For 100,000 HRT users/year:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[963]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Colo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rectal cancer 6 times decreases</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[964]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> HIP fracture 5 times decreases</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[965]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>P</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>roper</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> U</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>se</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[966]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Max 5yrs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[967]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> years</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; individual</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ized</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>decision</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[968]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> POF=&gt; C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ontraception</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or HRT up to age of Meno</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pause</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[969]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>RISKS:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[970]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Venous thromboembolism: 8 times more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[971]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cancer Breast: 8 times more (risk with combined </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hormones Replacement Therapy)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[972]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stroke: 7 times </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>more risk</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> increases with age.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[973]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MI: 6 times </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>more risk</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with combined </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hormones Replacement Therapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[974]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cancer ovary: 1.5 times </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[975]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CA endo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>metrium</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>estrogen Replacement Therapy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[976]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dementia: &gt;65yrs old</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[977]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gall Bladder Disease.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[978]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>FOLLOW-UP:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[979]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> visit</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[980]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after 3months to check efficiency.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[981]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thereafter - Annually.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[982]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>REFER TO HEALTH CARE PROFESSIONAL:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Menopausal symptoms + C/I to HRT (Cancer breast).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Troublesome S/E</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No improvement with HRT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uncertainty about suitable option.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[987]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[988]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>C</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>A</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> Breast:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don''t offer HRT, soy, clover, Cohosh, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vit E.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>asomotor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> symptoms: offer SSRI (but not to those who are taking tamoxifen).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Venlafaxine is offered.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Women with familial risk of CA Breast:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can be given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for short d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uration</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer ERT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> BR</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>C</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>A positive + Sapling</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>o</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>o</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ph</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>e</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>rectomy:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT if uterus i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntact</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> otherwise ERT until </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>the a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ge of Menopause.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>VTE:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer to Hematologist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FH of VTE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1001]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heredit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ry</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Thrombophilia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>consider Transdermal route in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>patients</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with high</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> risk</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of venous thromboembolism (VTE) including BMI &gt; 30.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1003]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>AVOID HRT:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1005]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In Patients with multiple Risk Factors Age, BMI, previous venous thromboembolism, post thrombotic syndrome, 1st degree relative with venous thromboembolism.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1006]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mmobility</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt;3days surgery &gt;60min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1007]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>M</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ore</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> risk of VTE</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in 1st year of use</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1008]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>HRT </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ADVICE BEFORE SURGERY</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1009]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop before elective surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1010]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No need to stop if Thromboprophylaxis is taken.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1011]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>RISK OF VTE INCREASES:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1012]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with conjugated equine E(Premarin) as compared to valerate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1013]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>With pregnane derivative progestogen as compared to Micronized.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1014]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>PERSONAL HISTORY OF VTE:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1015]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/I of oral HRT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if needed then </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transdermal route is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>preferred</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>along with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Anti-coagulant Thromboprophylaxis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>DIABETES:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT can be given.</span></p>', 0);

