<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1140]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>1</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>. PMS:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1141]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Incidence = 40%.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Severe PMS = 5 – 8%.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Psychological Symptoms:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Depression, irritability, loss of interest, mood swings, loss of confidenc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>due to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>serotonin + GABA receptors.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Physical symptoms:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bloatedness,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Mastalgia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More in luteal phase.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1148]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Etiology:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Two theories </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>w</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>omen </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PMS progesterone levels are</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> same but </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>increased </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sensitivity</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neurotransmitters</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> serotonin receptors r sensitive to E &amp; P</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SSRI    e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> symptoms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>GABA levels r modulated by Allopregnanolone (progesterone metabolite) in PMS allopregnanolone is    ed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms diary over 2 months before starting treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if inconclusive =&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>trial of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> GnRH Analogues A for 3 months for definitive diagnosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Referral:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Gynecologist:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>when simple measures failed</span></p>
