<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1162]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Psychiatrist: </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1163]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> non-cyclical symptoms, under lying psychotic or somatic disorder.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>MDT: Severe PMS</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1165]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gyn</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecologists</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mental health professional</span></p>
