<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1184]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drosperinone containing pills</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1185]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drosperinone = 3mg + Eth</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nyl Estradiol = 20</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1186]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>YAZ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: 3mg/30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1187]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - low dose OCP 24/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1188]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Yasmin: 3mg/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1189]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Percutaneous Estradiol:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1190]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Along with endometrial protection</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1191]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Implants unlicensed in UK for PMS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1192]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contraception should be given with implants</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1193]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> where oral E is C/I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>like Pts with RF for VTE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Endometrial protection</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1195]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Norethisterone 2.5mg</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Micronized progesterone</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>,</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>O</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> 100-200</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>µ</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>g </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(D17-D2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>8 or</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> for 10-12days)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>, act as diuretic also improve PMS symptoms.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1198]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>vaginal</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> avoid psychoactive metabol</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ite</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> formation like </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Allopregnanolone (ALLO)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>so </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>considered</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> first line.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>LNG</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>–</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> ius</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>52m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> low levels of LNG can initially produce</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PMS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> type </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>side </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effect</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and bleeding problems</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1200]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>4.</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Danazol: </strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1201]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low dose 200mg B.D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for Breast symptoms </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1202]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Androgenic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> S/E </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective contraception while on danazol to avoid fetal effects</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1204]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>5.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>GnRH Analogues:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>highly effective 60-75%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1206]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not recommended routinely</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>severe PMS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> diagnosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1208]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dd-back Therapy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if GnRH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> given &gt; 6months</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in the form of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CCT or Tibolone</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1209]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dexa scan </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>yearly in women with treatment on GnRH analogues.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1210]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>6.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>SSRI</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>severe</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> PMS:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1211]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Luteal phase or continuous.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1212]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective for physical/psychological symptoms</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1213]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E: Nausea, insomnia, somnolence, Fatigue, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>loss of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>libido</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1214]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Withdrawal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> headache, Fatigue, dizziness, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>paresthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, sleep disturbance.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Gradual withdrawal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1215]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>limited data on pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1216]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cardiac defect reported so stop before pregnancy. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1217]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>7.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>SNRI</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1218]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>venlafaxine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PMDD pre</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>menstrual</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dysphoric disorder.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1219]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>8.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Spironolactone</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1220]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>improvement in mood, </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1221]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effective in bloating, edema, fluid retention type symptoms</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1222]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>9.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Surgical t/m; TAH = BSO</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1223]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> when:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1224]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> treatment failed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1225]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Long term GnRH analogues required</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1226]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Other gynaecological conditions indicating surgery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1227]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>GnRH Analogues must be </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>tried as test of curse</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before surgery. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1228]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HRT before </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>45yrs if TAH</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + BSO done for PMS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1229]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Testosterone after oophorectomy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1230]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pre 1st line:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1231]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Exercise</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CBT</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>B-6</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(offered to all)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1232]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1st line: </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; Mild symptoms</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1233]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>COC</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></p>
