<div class="mm-table-scroll mm-table-floating-reflow" role="region" tabindex="0" data-mm-tblp-left-from-text="180" data-mm-tblp-right-from-text="180" data-mm-tblp-vert-anchor="text" data-mm-tblp-horz-anchor="margin" data-mm-tblp-x-spec="center" data-mm-tblp-y="208" style="clear:both;margin-left:9pt;margin-right:9pt;"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:540pt;table-layout:fixed;margin-left:0pt;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:283.25pt;"><col style="width:256.75pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="300" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:283.25pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">xx</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:256.75pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">xy</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="300" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:283.25pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">1.TURNER:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Typical =&gt; p0 Amenorrhea, subfertility</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Atypical =&gt; 15% (menses, fertility, SSC Normal</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Incidence = 1/200</li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Streak gonads</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Risk of cataract, leukemia</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Life expectancy 55 years.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ovum donation – 27.5% pregnancy rate</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">RISK OF PREGNACY – MDT:</p><ol style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">1.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>HTN – 15-17%</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">2.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Aortic dissection 1-2%</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">3.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>CS- 80-100%</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">4.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>PTB – 12-38%</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">5.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Low birth 18-57%</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">6.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Typhoid problem</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">7.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>DM </li></ol><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Management of Turner:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Puberty induction: done in collaboration with paedsS endocrinologist.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Breast development: in 2 stages.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>1st stage = low dose estrogen to avoid irregular breast development either oral or transdermal.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>2nd stage = progesterone after 2 years of estrogen.</li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Fertility option:</li></ul><ol style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">1.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Fertility preservation if ovulating like in mosaic.</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">2.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ovum donation.</li><li><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">3.</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Adoption.</li></ol><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="bb3ed32c5e4e7f5626b90c02" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-01-015"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure bb3ed32c5e4e7f5626b90c02" viewbox="2838450 133350 1552575 1019175" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="90ce68b39d36e5099e53cc09446ceced2cbbaf983b007aedb065caf4e2eee71c"><g data-mm-object-id="9d5899d7bff7401baf2e" transform="translate(2844371 134811)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1539240 0 L 1539240 1005840 L 0 1005840 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="91440" y="152400" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="548640" y="431165" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="548640" y="709930" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></svg></figure>2.MRKH: </p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>P0 Amenorrhea</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>20 SSC are normal</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">MRI: is gold standard Test</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Uterus absent</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ovaries present</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">No need of HRT.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:256.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">1.CAIS: complete androgen insensitivity syndrome.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Absent uterus </li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Breast developed.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Public/Axillary sparse – Tanner stage 2,3.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Treatment:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>ERT (no need of progestogen) after gonadectomy</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Gonadectomy after puberty at 18yrs, risk of malignancy 2%</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">2.SWYer’s Syndrome:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Absent SRY gene on Y Chromosome</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>External genitalia phenotypically – Female</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ambiguous Gentelia, clitoromegaly</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Infantile uterus</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">    SSC =&gt; underdeveloped.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">t/m =&gt; Gonadectomy:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Aptos"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Immediately due to risk of malignancy </li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">=&gt; HRT NO ERT</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">=&gt; Surrogacy /Adoption</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">=&gt; Vaginoplasty</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="300" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:283.25pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:256.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
