<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can be high or low</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Presentation:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abdominal pain </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Worsening dysmenorrhea</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Menstruation can be present – from communicating hemi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vaginum. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Haematocolpus + hematometra – from closed side</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterus Didelp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hys</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; obstetric complications.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>t/m:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Excision</span></p>
