<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1508]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI – Gold standard</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1509]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1510]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Karyotyping to exclude CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1511]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>X ray spine + limbs</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1512]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Echocardiogram</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>D/D</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CAIS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Imperforate Hymen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1516]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MANAGEMENT:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Psychological support:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1518]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Fertility:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1519]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Surrogacy (partial surrogacy) - egg retrieval via abdominal route</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1520]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1521]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Adoption</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1522]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Uterine transplant</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1523]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Creation of neo-vagina – </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>timing depend on sexual activity.</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1524]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Surgical:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1525]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(Out dated procedures)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1526]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>McIndoe procedure – </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>postponed until sexually active.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1527]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Split skin graft between rectum and bladder over a Mould for 3 months.</span></p>
