<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1821]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>practical for limited areas of skin</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1822]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cause burns, Depigmentation, skin scarring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1823]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>laser </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Photo thermolysis</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> or selective </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Photo thermolysis</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1824]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Appropriate for light skinned women. As they require lower Radiation pulses. Dark women =&gt; laser with cooling devices.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1825]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Covers wider area.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1826]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Less painful.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1827]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduces hair density permanently by 30% after 3-4 sessions.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1828]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In PCOS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>density of hirsutism by laser.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1829]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hormonal Therapies:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Conversion of Terminal hairs to villus hairs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1832]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Long t/m - requiring 9-12months</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1833]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1834]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>COCP:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1835]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don''t reverse </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hirsutism, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>need for shaving by 50% &amp; inhibit Progression.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1836]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SHBG + inhibits LH hormone &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testosterone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1837]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drosperinone containing pills (Yasmin) more effective</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1838]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> risk of Endometrial Hyperplasia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1839]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cycle regularity</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1840]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1841]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Cyproterone acetate CA:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1842]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decrease </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LH =&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> decrease</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testosterone &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Androstenedione</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1843]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Act as </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>an </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>androgen Antagonist Peripherally.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1844]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lower Ferr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>man Score by 15 – 40% within 6months,</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1845]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Max effect 6 – 12months. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1846]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Diane 35</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (EE 35mg, 2mg CA)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1847]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E: wt gain, Depression, fatigue, sexual dysfunction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1848]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Altered LFT’s (do LFT’s before CA), VTE more than 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> generation COCP. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1849]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Androcur</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> high dose C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50mg.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1850]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Given in women who r resistant to low dose</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> CA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> along with EE for short term use.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1851]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1852]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Spironolactone: </strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1853]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aldosterone Antagonist + mild Diuretics </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1854]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Androgen inhibitor + structurally similar to progesterone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1855]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/20</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> efficiency for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dihydrotestosterone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> receptor binding </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>so</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> high doses r required.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1856]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>100mg/ day is superior to low dose CA 12.5mg/day &amp; Finasteride 5mg/day for up to 12m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>onths</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1857]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Finasteride:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> inhibitor of 5alpha reductas</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1858]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Used for t/m of BPH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1859]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Similar efficiency as CA but few S/E.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1860]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Feminiz</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ation of female fetus</span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-01-022-1', 't-mm-01-022', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Flutamide:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Non-steroidal anti androgens, Block androgen receptors &amp;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>high</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> doses </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>inhibit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>production of androgens.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1862]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Used in t/m of CA prostate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1863]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E: Greenish tinge to urine, Dry scalp and skin, abnormal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> LFT''s (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LFT''s should be checked before t/m).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1864]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>250 - 500mg/day</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1865]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1866]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Insulin Sensitizers:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1867]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Improve hirsutism in PCOS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1868]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effective in both</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Obese </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> lean</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> women</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1869]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1870]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Cell cycle Inhibitors:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1871]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Eflornithine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> inhibits ornithine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>decarboxylas</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in skin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1872]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Topical use twice/day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1873]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rapidly absorbed (within 5min).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1874]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduce hair growth by 60%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1875]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop if no benefit after 4months.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1876]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>S/E:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acn</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e, photosensitivity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1877]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>GnRH-A</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> loss of BMD 2-8% over 6months</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1878]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1879]"> </p>
