<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1893]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prolong bleeding after injury</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1894]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fail to respond to conventional therapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1895]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>VWD:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> most common bleeding disorder in UK.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1896]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Type I:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1897]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common type</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1898]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Milder</span></p>
