<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1906]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common platelet disorder in adolescence</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1907]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7% present with HMB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1908]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosis on blood film</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1909]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Inher</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ited Factor</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Malgun Gothic Semilight", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ⅸ</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> and VIII</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1910]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider in HMB in adolescence </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1911]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Family history can be suggestive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1912]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Endocrinopathies:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1913]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Thyroid Disease:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1914]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypothyroid important cause of HMB.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1915]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symptoms of Hypothyroid + Heavy or irregular bleeding.</span></p>
