<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2047]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exogenous steroids.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2048]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Clinical Examination:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2049]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Height, weight using age specific charts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2050]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BMI.</span></p>
