<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2061]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2062]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Goals:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2063]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Halt or regression of SSC.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2064]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prevent early menarche.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2065]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Retard skeletal maturation and improve height – growth hormone can be added.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2066]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid psychological/ Behavioral/ sexual sequence. </span></p>
