<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><u><strong>SUBFERTILITY</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FERTILITY PROBLEMS ASSESSMENT AND TREATMENT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.1. ASSESSMENT OF FEMALE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.2. ASSESSMENT OF MALE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.3. MANAGEMENT OF FEMALE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.4. INDICATIONS OF IUI – DONOR INDICATIONS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2161]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.5. INDICATIONS OF IVF</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2162]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1.6. REFERAL CRITERIA OF IVF</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2163]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ARTIFICIAL REPRODUCTIVE TECHNIQUE – PROCEDURE OVERVIEW</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Bradley Hand ITC", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Lucida Handwriting", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>Dr Mahwish javed</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FERTILITY PRESERVATION.</span></p>
