<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ASSESSMENT OF UNEXPLAINED SUBFERTILITY.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2167]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TUBAL SURGERY </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2168]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MANAGEMENT OF INFERTILE COUPLE.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2169]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>8. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EARLY OVARIAN AGING.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2170]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>9. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LONG TERM CONSEQUENCES OF PCOD.</span></p>
