<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Aptos", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>ASSESSMENT OF MALE PARTNER:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span></p>
