<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>WHO criteria:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2289]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PH = 7.2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2290]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Volume = 1.5ml or more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2291]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sperm count = 39million/ ejaculate or more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2292]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sperm con</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntration</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = 15million/ml or more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2293]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Motility:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2294]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Total 40%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2295]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Progressive 32%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vitality = 58% or more.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Morphology = 4% normal or more.</span></p>
