<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Except Azoospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or severe ol</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
