<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat as early as possible.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2304]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Anti-Sperm Anti bodies: N</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ot recommended</strong></span></p>
