<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2420]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>CC resistance:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Move to 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>2</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><em><strong>nd</strong></em></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> line:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ovarian drilling</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CC + Met</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>formin</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> if not</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Given before.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Gonadotrophins</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Routine USG Monitoring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>To rule out</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OHSS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Multiple</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>PCOS:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Who are given Gonadotrophins should avoid GnRH Analogues due to risk of OHSS &amp; it does not improve pregnancy rate.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>GH</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> NR.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>hyperprolactinemia:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dopamine agonists.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>letrozole</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> not licensed </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>f</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or OI in UK.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CC resistance = no ovulation with cc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CC failure = no pregnancy despite ovulation</span></p>
