<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tructed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Azo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospermia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2456]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tructed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>azo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ospermia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe male factor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of transmission of genetic disorder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of transmission of infection to women/offspring from male.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iso</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>immu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> RH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>incompatibility</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Steps in IUI:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Screening of sperms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment of women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovulation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Assessment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tubal assessment after 3 cycles.</span></p>
