<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[2962]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Expectant:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 74% success.</span></p>
