<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3060]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><strong>Abnormal Anatomy 5 – 30%</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>IVF:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>- Treatment of choice for multifactor and &gt;5year duration.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>Myomectomy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>in </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>submucosal</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong> fibroid</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>     If myoma is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>&gt;40mm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>Polypectomy:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>Pre IVF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>Septostomy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>Pre IVF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''><u><strong>Adhesions:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>Pre IVF</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3061]"> </p>
