<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.ASCITIES</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. Palpable</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mass</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Peritonism</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Abdominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> girth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Respiratory :</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3298]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effusion, pneumonia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pulmonary edema</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3299]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigations:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3300]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FBC</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3302]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CRP</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urea, Electrolytes    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Na,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> K.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3304]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Osmolality</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LFTS -    </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>albumin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3306]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>         -     enzymes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Coagulatio</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n:    fibrinogen, Antithromb</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3308]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3309]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3310]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovarian size</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3311]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ascites</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3312]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doppler</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3313]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If torsion suspected.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3314]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Other Tests</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3315]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D – Dim</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ers </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3316]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ABGS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3317]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ECG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3318]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ECHO</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3319]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CXR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3320]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTPA, V/Q scan.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3321]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3322]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Classification of OHSS &amp; Management</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3323]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mild:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3324]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild bloating</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3325]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3326]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovarian size &lt;8cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>3</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3327]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mod</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>erate</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mod pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3330]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG Ascites</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Size 8 – 12.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>OUTPATIENT MANAGEMENT </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3333]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild + Mod + selected severe cases:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3334]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- fluid intake – drink to thirst @ least 1liter/D.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- UOP monitoring </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3336]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Detailed counselling of worsening signs:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Abd girth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weight gain shortness of breath</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3340]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HR, T    B.P.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3341]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UOP (&lt;1000ml/24hrs, +ve fluid balance).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3342]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3343]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contact details should be provided</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Avoid NSAIDS, </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>aracetamol</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Opioids are given to relive pain.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3346]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- follow up: 2 – 3 days </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3347]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Worsening signs = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urgent review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3348]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Lab investigations: repeated if worsening signs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- paracentesis: OPD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Basis (TAS, TVS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- GnR</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Ant, Dopamine agonist insufficient evidence but beneficial role.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- VTE prophylaxis in mod</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> OHSS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stocking or LMWH if risk factor for VTE present.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hospital Admission Criteria:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3353]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Critical OHSS + Severe OHSS (selected)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3354]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to come for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>follow up</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3355]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to achieve pain control</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3356]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to take oral fluids due to NV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3357]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Worsening signs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3358]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Severe OHSS:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3359]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clinical Ascites </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Hydrothorax.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3360]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oliguria (&lt;300ml/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or &lt;30ml/hour).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3361]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT &gt; 0.45</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3362]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Na &lt;135</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3363]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Osmolality &lt;282</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3364]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>K &gt;5</span></p>
