1pt''>- suspected or confirmed deep endometriosis involving Bowel, Bladder, or ureter.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong>Includes:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Gynecologist </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Nurse </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Colorectal surgeon </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Advance imaging </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Fertility services.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Pa</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>e</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>driatic/Adolescent Gynecology:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PSN</span></p>
