<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3544]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>During D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iagnostic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lapar</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oscopy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> consider treatment if:</span></p>
