<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4068]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4069]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4070]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>           </strong></u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>RMI &gt; 200</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>CT abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>omen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> + Pelvis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Referral to Gynaecological oncology MDT review.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4071]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>             </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>RMI &lt; 200</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4072]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>G</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>eneral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> Gyn</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>ecologist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4073]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>OR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4074]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Gynecologist in cancer center</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4075]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Symptomatic </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Non simple</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>&gt; 5 cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Multilocular</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Bilateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>Consider surgery BSO.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4076]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>MDT Review</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>High likelihood </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Of malignancy of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Ovary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>Laparotomy </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>Staging by </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>Oncologist include:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1. laparotomy with clear documentation.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>2. cytolog</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>y of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>washing/Ascites</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>3.TAH + BSO + omentectomy.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>4. Biopsy from suspicious areas.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>5. may include pelvic/abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>omen,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>para-aortic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>lymphadenectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><strong>BOT</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> =&gt; Staging laparotomy by oncologist/ Gynaecologist according to MDT review.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>Cyst Aspiration:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>25% sensitivity of cytological examination</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>To control symptoms if Pt is unfit for surgery.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>25% recurrence in 1 year after aspiration.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>New 2025 Update:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Simple, unilateral, unilocular, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Cystic lesion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u>&lt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> 3cm do not require routine follow up. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Asymptomatic </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4077]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Any of 1 feature </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Simple</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4078]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Unilocular</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4079]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Low like</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>lihood</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> of ovarian malignancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Laparotomy by trained Gynaecologist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>3cm - </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u>&lt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> 5cm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4080]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Unilateral </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4081]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Consider conservative</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4082]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4083]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Reassessment after</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4084]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>4 – 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> with TVS </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4085]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>&amp; CA – 125.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4086]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4087]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Change in features.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>- Persistent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>- unchanged</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Repeat assessment in 4 – 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4088]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Resolve </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4089]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>50%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> resolve</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4090]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>In 3months</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4091]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4092]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Discharge </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4093]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Change in feature</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>       </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Consider</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> intervention</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>- persistent </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Individualized treatment after discussion with women</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4094]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Resolve</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4095]"> </p>
