<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4251]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bladder is intraperitoneal =&gt; problem with supra pubic port.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4252]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urethral trauma while catheterization &lt;10 years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4253]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aorta just below skin in skinny children.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4254]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lift up umbilicus before port insertion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4255]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pneumoperitoneum @ 12 – 15mm hg in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adolesants</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4256]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>          8 – 10 in children.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4257]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Port size Hernia – use 2 – 5mm port.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4258]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Close fascia &gt; 10mm port size.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4259]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep camera on while removing umbilical port due to risk of omental evisceration.</span></p>
