<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>ADNEXAL MASSES IN PREGNANCY</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4283]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Adnexal Mass on USG</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4284]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4285]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asymptomatic </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Abdomen</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4286]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Simple 76%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resolve in 16</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>wks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspiscious </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tumor marker</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MDT</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4289]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 5 cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No further Action</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>      </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 5 cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Re – scan in </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>4 – 6 weeks.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4290]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4291]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4292]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low index of suspicious.</span></p>
