<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High index of suspicion.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unchanged </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Re – scan after 6 w</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ks postnatal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> postnatal</span></p>
