<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4669]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4670]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Paclitaxel:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Given with oral dexa</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>methasone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mg, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>12 hours prior to avoid hypersensitivity reactions, It impairs blood glucose, so used with caution</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4671]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cisplatin:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pre</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> post hydration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4672]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Bleomycin:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> don’t cause my</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>elo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>suppression.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Etoposide:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Both oral and I/V.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Carboplatin:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dosed acc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to creatinine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> levels</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>BRCA Gene:</strong></u></span></p>
