<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chromosome 17</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Autosomal dominant </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gene</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> defect.</span></p>
