-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ultra-potent steroids.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Vaginal steroid</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>hydrocortisone with applicators at sensitive areas and mild disease.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:89.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Lichen Simplex</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:257.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Thickened pale, scaly, leathery skin.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Involvement of thigh, pubic hair often lost @ site of itching.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">H/P: Epithelial thickening, mitosis in Basel and prickle layers.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:205.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Emollient soap.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Topical steroids.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="58" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:89.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Paget’s disease.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:257.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Red, pink, crusty, white cake icing effect, strawberry cream effect, velvety texture, islands of keratosis.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">H/P: rounded, atypical cells with oval nuclei, pale cytoplasm.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:205.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Wide load excision.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>2 weeks referral pathway</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Examination of breast, Anus.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">F/U: Anal, vulva extension and breast examination 3m0 for 2 years then annually.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:89.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Vulval Crohn’s</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:257.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Swollen, edematous, granules, abscesses and draining sinuses.</li></ul></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:205.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:89.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style=