<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Young women 35 – 55 years</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Association with HPV – 16. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4921]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Less risk of cancer = 10%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4922]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Multifocal Multicentric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> lesions</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4923]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Warty/Basaloid SSC.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4924]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical treatment more effective.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4925]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Differentiated VIN:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4926]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Less common.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Old women 55 – 85 years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Associated with Lichen sclerosis and Lichen Planus.</span></p>
