<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4936]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Imiquimod 5%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4937]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fluorouracil</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cream.</span></p>
