s="341" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:187.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Distant Mets * pelvic N.</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="456" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td colspan="3" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:114.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Unknown stage 81%.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4968]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>Table </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>11</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>. CA </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>–</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em> Vulva</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4969]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4970]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4971]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4972]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4973]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4974]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Incisional Biopsy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>: for diagnosis of malignancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4975]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Excisional Biopsy:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> where low suspicion of invasive C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> and operator wishes to limit the cosmetic harm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4976]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Radical Excision:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>  At least 1cm clear margins.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4977]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Wide/ local Excision:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> Margins of 15mm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4978]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Triple incision/ Butterfly incision:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4979]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Ipsilateral L nodes dissection</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> =&gt; positive on biopsy =&gt; do contralateral dissection as interval procedu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>re</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4980]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4981]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4982]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Wide local excision (no LND)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> indications</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stage 1a </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SCC</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Verrucous</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VIN</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Basel cell</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> carcinoma</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Melanoma</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Reconstructive surgery.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5 years’ </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>survival</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> ac</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>cording</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> to LN – diagnos</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>is</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Negative </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>92%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ipsilateral</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>75%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B/L</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>30%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 2 nodes</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>25%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 6 nodes</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Multimodal Therapy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tumor &gt;2cm + close to vital organs (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urethra/Anu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s) + &gt;1mm invasion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Radio =&gt; to reduce size =&gt; then surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrent Bartholin Absc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ess:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Biopsy to exclude CA.</span></p>
