<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After MDT discussion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5200]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contraception during treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5201]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t change OCP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5202]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t remove IUS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Condom promote hrHPV clearance and CIN1 regression with consistent use of 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5204]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Menopausal:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Topical E improve colposcopy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5206]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><u><strong>CGIN &amp; SMIILE:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All cases should be discussed in colposcopy MDT meeting.</span></p>
