M 0 0 L 1156038 0 L 1156038 422031 L 0 422031 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="bc49160be0839618e542" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-bc49160be0839618e542)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ce71af21c15c33d120c48c2167036eee517b15828410a56b1b0309cec96135f2.jfif" x="0" y="-457200.25" width="1260481.49682709" height="1810980.94747683" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure> </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:126.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">1. urethral stricture.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">2. External urethral compression.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">3. Prolapse – (Bladder outflow obstruction).</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">4. A contractile detrusor.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:141.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">3. Very High Q Max</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-04-005"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 16c3082e0ca1021f3cc153c1" viewbox="0 0 1057275 657225" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="738e11df189603dc1edda3e79be86cf068e4e7fc7f3099dc2630a6481ef59332"><defs><clippath id="clip-1595a7a747ba876c41b6" clippathunits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 0 0 L 1049530 0 L 1049530 650435 L 0 650435 Z"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id="1595a7a747ba876c41b6" transform="translate(0 0)"><g transform="translate(0 0)" clip-path="url(#clip-1595a7a747ba876c41b6)"><image href="/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ce71af21c15c33d120c48c2167036eee517b15828410a56b1b0309cec96135f2.jfif" x="-93803.01996013" y="-1160604.95545037" width="1260454.44719333" height="1811039.95545037" preserveaspectratio="none"></image></g></g></svg></figure></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:126.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">1. Detrusor over Activity. </p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cystometry:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Normal cytogram.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5453]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5454]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Bladder Volume = 300 – 600ml.  </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>(decrease</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> in OAB &amp; fibrosis</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>)</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Residual volume &lt;50ml.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5456]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Flow rate 15 – 20 ml/sec.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Flow time 20 sec.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>detrusor pressure = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>&lt;</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 15cm of H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub><u><strong>2</strong></u></sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>O, Filling phase</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>voiding phase </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>&lt;</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 70mm of</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub><u><strong>2</strong></u></sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>O.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5460]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5461]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Voiding problems:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Capacity     &gt; 600ml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>F</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> rate &lt; 15 – 20ml/sec.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Eva</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cuation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> time   .</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5466]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PVR    &gt;50ml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5467]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urodynamic SI:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5468]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Same as</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> normal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> except leakage on </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Valsalva</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or abdominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pressure without</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> increasing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> detrusor pressure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5469]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5470]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Detrusor pressure (N) @ time leak.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5471]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No contractions @ time of leak.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5472]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Difference between SUI &amp; DOA.</strong></u></span></p>
