<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>indications of </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Urodynamic:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Not relieved by Medication</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BPS + SI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5832]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BPS + UI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5833]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BPS + outflow obstruction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5834]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>BPS on </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>cytometry</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5835]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pain on filling</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5836]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Capacity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5837]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sensation to void.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5838]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BPS + OAB = 14%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5839]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>BPS and Pregnancy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5840]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effect of pregnancy on BPS – variable 7% improvement.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5841]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe treatment – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ami</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tri</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ptyl</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntravesical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> heparin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5842]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DMSO – Teratogenic in animals.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5843]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sacral N stimulator – turn off.</span></p>
