<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5936]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Renal USG</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abnormality detected</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5937]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Voiding studies</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[5938]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cystoscopy</span></p>
