"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Bacterial vaginosis:</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Common cause of discharge</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 20-40 years of age</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- fishy odor after intercourse because semen is alkaline.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:53.6pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">5-50%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">TOP 30%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Pregnancy 12%</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Hay Ison </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Amsel’s</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">G staining</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*metronidazole 400mg, B.D, 5-7days, P/O  or 0.75% IV, 5day</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">* clindamycin= 2% P/V for 7D</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:54.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Tinidazole 2g</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">OR</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Clinda 30mg P/O x 7days</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.65pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Metronidazole 0.75 I/V x OD for 16D</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not recommended</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not recommended</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:51.05pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*HIV – same t/m</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*TOP – same t/m</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Pregnancy – I/V</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Lactation – I/V</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Avoid oral</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Trichomonas</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Sexually transmitted </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*frothy discharge 20-40yrs of age</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:53.6pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Asymptomatic 10-15%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Discharge 70%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Frothy 30%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Strawberry cervix 2%</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- urethral dx 20%</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Microscopy – initial HVS, VVS</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Culture high sensitivity</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">NAAT gold std </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- VVS</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- HVS</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Urine samples</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Metronidazole</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">400mg BD 5-7days</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">OR</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">2g Stat P/O or P/R</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:54.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Tinidazole 2g stat</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.65pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Tinidazole</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- expensive</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Long t/2</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Remain in tissues</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- more tissue penetration</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Non Responders</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- repeat regimen</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- High dose</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Metronidazole 2g 0D for</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">5 – 7D or 800TDS 7D</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Tinidazole 1g TDS 14D, 2G B.D 14days</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Recommended If </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- symptoms after t/m or</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Recurrence.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Any partner within 4weeks tested for STI.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:51.05pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">HIV: B.D regimen for 7days</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">2g dose not effective</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Pregnancy – I/V</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="ee148b917be0c349b5b49f2e" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-05-002"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure ee148b917be0c349b5b49f2e" viewbox="762000 209550 219075 152400" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="9b287d3a5e5b93454c241dc3d8c6df2b7a6c96ea90cc313fb523f93b1e13615c"><g data-mm-object-id="4ab62a30d6f755012d3d" transform="translate(795201 236583)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 87086 L 68035.5 0 L 136071 87086 Z" fill="#4472C4" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#223962" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Tind C/I in 1st    </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Lactation 12 weeks</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Avoid lactation</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="2250" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">VVC</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 20-40yrs</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Low immunity</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">=&gt;vulval + under Breast = candiasis</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">=&gt;vulval + intra Breast pargets</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:53.6pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">90-90% candida Albicans</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*75% women @ least single episode</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*45%@ least (2) episode</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">20% asymptomatic with colonization</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">(absence of neutrophils on microscopy)</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Microscopy wet film </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">HVS</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">No pseudohyphea in candida Glabrata</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Neutrophils – candida albicans</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Blastophores – Candida Albicans</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Psendo hyphae – Candida Albicans</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Culture</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Sabouraud media</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.3pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Fluconazole 150 P/O or *clotrimazole 500mg p/v</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Severe Fluconazole D1 &amp; D4 or clotrimazole 500 D1 &amp; D4</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:54.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Clotrimazole cream 5g stat or clotrimazole pessary 200mg 3 nights.</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:65.65pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*Fluconazole daily for 72 hours then weekly for 6m0 or *clotrimazole or topical imidazole daily 7 – 14days till response then 6m0 *or clotrimazole 500 weekly or * 50 – 100/day.</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:63.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not recommended</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:61.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not recommended</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:51.05pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Pregnancy</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- topical or I/V</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- longer course clotrimazole 500 for 7ays</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="1414" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td colspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Non Albicans</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Nystatin 100000 p/v 12-14nights.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Boric acid or amphotericin B or flucytosine cream</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
