<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6446]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ABORTION CARE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6447]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prompt referral</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6448]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid repeating key steps like returning to GP for referral or re assessment or investigations.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6449]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Self-referral is accepted.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6450]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment within 1 week of request.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abortion within 1 week of assessment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood test = not routinely required, blood group is needed if &gt;12weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6453]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>VTE prophylaxis:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6454]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH for 7 days</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High risk for thrombosis =&gt; start LMWH before abortion and for longer duration afterwards.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6456]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Choice of Procedure for Abortion.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer choice.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If clinically not appropriate, then explain why.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Determining duration of Pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. LMP – all pts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. USG if uncertainty or risk of ectopic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. Examination – If USG available</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abortion before USG evidence of I/U pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before USG evidence</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>small risk of ectopic</span></p>
