<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6531]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6532]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contraindication of Medical Abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6533]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspected or known ectopic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6534]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Allergy to miso</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prostol</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or Mifepristone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6535]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe uncontrolled asthma.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6536]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chronic adrenal failure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6537]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Inherited porphyria</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6538]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Extra consideration of Medical Abortion;</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6539]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Long term steroid therapy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6540]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> because mife</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pristone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can exacerbate underlying conditions as it is a glucocorticoid receptor antagonist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6541]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>On anticoagulants</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6542]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of bleeding – so should be stopped before abortion and started again after procedure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6543]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bleeding disorders</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6544]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Need clinical setting.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6545]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symptomatic anemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6546]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Need hospital setting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6547]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD in place.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6548]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD should ideally be removed in advance of treatment if not retrieved then confirm its presence by X – ray abdomen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6549]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contraindication of surgical Abortion</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6550]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Where pregnancy cannot be removed through cervix.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6551]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Extra consideration of Surgical Abortion.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6552]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bleeding disorders.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6553]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal placentation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6554]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use of anti-coagulants</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6555]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe cardiopulmonary disease.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6556]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Very high BMI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6557]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Distorted uterine cavity by fibroids or any other anomaly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6558]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Previous cervical surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6559]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Type 3 FGM.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6560]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>These cases need extra care like use of special instruments, type of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, ultrasound and guidance</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6561]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6562]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><u><em><strong>Table </strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><u><em><strong>14</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><u><em><strong>. </strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><u><em><strong>Medical Abortion Dosage:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<div class="mm-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:107.9pt;"><col style="width:107.9pt;"><col style="width:107.9pt;"><col style="width:107.9pt;"><col style="width:107.9pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Gestation</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Mifepristone</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Misoprostol</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Repeat Misoprostol</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Until</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Before 12 weeks can be performed at home</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">200mg stat 24 – 48 hours before miso P/O</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">800mg P/V, S/C or buccal stat</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">400ug P/V, S/L, buccal if abortion don’t happen in 4 hours</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">----</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not available</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">800ug P/V, S/L or buccal stat</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">400ug p/v, s/c buccal every 3 hours</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">expulsion</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">After 12 weeks under taken at hospital setting</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">200ug stat p/o 24 – 48 hours before miso</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">800ug p/v, s/L or buccal stet</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">400ug p/v, s/L buccal every 3 hours</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">expulsion</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Not available</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">800ug p/v, s/L or buccal stet</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">400ug p/v, s/L buccal every 3 hours</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Expulsion</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6563]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6564]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6565]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pain Management for Medical Abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6566]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Should be given always</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6567]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDS – either prophylactic or at time of cramping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6568]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non – pharmacological – hot </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>water,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>heat pads.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6569]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Narcotic analgesics if pain is more especially in higher gestation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6570]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Surgical Abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6571]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Before 14 weeks:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6572]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vacuum aspiration either</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6573]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Electric vacuum aspiration EVA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6574]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual vacuum aspiration MVA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6575]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MVA accommodate 4 – 12mm cannula.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6576]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All products should be inspected after evacuation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6577]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>12 – 14 weeks:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6578]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dilatation and evacuation D &amp; E.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6579]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D &amp; E require cer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vical preparation using </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dilators</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or pharmacological agents, skilled, experienced care provider.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6580]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vacuum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> aspiration can be done up till 16 weeks using large cannula 16mm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6581]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D &amp; C (dilation and curettage) is an obsolete method.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6582]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cervical preparation before surgical Abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6583]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cervix preparation reduces risk of incomplete abortion.</span></p>
<div class="mm-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:36pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:119.7pt;"><col style="width:86.8pt;"><col style="width:98.35pt;"><col style="width:84.15pt;"><col style="width:114.5pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Gestation</p></td><td colspan="4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:383.8pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Methods of preparation</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Before 12 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:86.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Mifepristone</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Or miso</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Or miso</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:98.35pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">200mg</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">400mg</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">400mg</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:84.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">P/O</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">S/L</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">P/V, buccal</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:114.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">24 – 48hours before</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">1 – 2 hours before</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">2 – 3 hours before</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">12 – 18+6weeks</p></td><td colspan="4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:383.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Combination of MISO and mifepristone as Above or</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Osmotic dilators plus </li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Either Mifepristone or MISO</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Or both using above regimen.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:119.7pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">19 – 24weeks</p></td><td colspan="4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:383.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Osmotic dilators plus</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Either mifepristone or MISO</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Or both.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6584]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>Table </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>15</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>. </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##44546A; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''><em>Cervical preparation before surgical Abortion</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6585]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6586]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6587]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6588]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6589]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6590]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pain Management for Surgical</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> TOP</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6591]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analgesia should always be offered:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6592]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most of the times:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6593]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6594]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Local anesthesia</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Verbal reassurance</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6595]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Conscious sedation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6596]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>General Anesthesia:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6597]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not recommended routinely, if considered then use I/V pr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pofol and fentanyl rather inhalational agents.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6598]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Local anesthesia:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6599]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lidocaine as Para cervical block can be used to alleviate discomfort from cervical dilatation and uterine evacuation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6600]"> </p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-05-005-1', 't-mm-05-005', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6601]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Conscious Sedation:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6602]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Should be offered with local anesthesia if available.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6603]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Medical Management of Incomplete Abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6604]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>No evidence of Infection</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6605]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6606]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6607]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Uterine size &lt; 14 weeks</strong></em></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>uterine size &gt; 14 weeks</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6608]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6609]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MISO 400ug s/L </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>buccal</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 14 – 24 weeks – MISO 400ug S/L, </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6610]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MISO 600ug orally</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>buccal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, P/V.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6611]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evacuation by vacuum aspiration</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> repeat 3 hourly</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6612]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> up to 16 weeks’ vacuum aspiration</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6613]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>3.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after 16 weeks’ dilatation and evacuation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6614]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6615]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6616]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6617]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6618]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Incomplete Abortion + Infection:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6619]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Broad spectrum antibiotics, I/V if infection is severe.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6620]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Surgical evacuation urgently.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6621]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer to facility where expertise available</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6622]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Septic Shock</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6623]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V antibiotics immediately.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6624]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Referral to HDU</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6625]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediately</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6626]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ampicillin 0.5 – 1g every 6 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6627]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Metronidazole 500mg every 8 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6628]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gentamicin 12mg daily with monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6629]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contraception after abortion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6630]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Access to C/C on same day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6631]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Implants</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6632]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Day of surgical abortion or day of mifepristone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6633]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>IUD</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6634]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ time of surgical TOP or after expulsion of pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6635]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>DMPA</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6636]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ time of mifepristone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6637]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of ongoing pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6638]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Tubal Ligation:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6639]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Should be done after some time to avoid regret and failure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6640]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All methods except IUD can be stated on the time of mifepristone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6641]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD can be initiated after surgical procedure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[6642]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Additional contraception is not required if contraception initiated immediately or with 5 days of abortion.</span></p>
