<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Symptoms (pain, dyspareunia, heavy bleeding)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Age </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 45 years</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Age &lt; 45 years but with factors for endometrial cancer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No other symptoms</span></p>
