INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-001-0', 't-mm-06-001', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-06-001" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7823]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>1. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>OBTAINING VALID CONSENT:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7824]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Consent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Is a pt’s agreement for a health professional to provide care.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7825]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Type:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7826]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non – verbal like presenting arm to check B.P.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7827]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Verbal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7828]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Written.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7829]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>For a valid consent:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Be competent to make the particular decision</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Have received sufficient information to make decision</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7832]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not be acting under stress.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7833]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Competent or having capacity:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7834]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Capacity </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>consists</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of following:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7835]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ability to comprehend &amp; retain information</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7836]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A belief in information given</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7837]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ability to use information given to arrive @ a decision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7838]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A Pt may have the capacity to Consent to some decision but not others. A Pt’s capacity may vary with factors such as confusion, Panic, Shock, Fatigue pain/ Medication. But such factors may not automatically render a pt incapable of Consent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7839]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Adults with Incapacity:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7840]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before making </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>decision,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> you must:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7841]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Make care of women your 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> concern</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7842]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treat them as individuals.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7843]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Respect their dignity and not discriminate against them.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7844]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Support and encourage the women to be involved in decisions about their treatment and care as far as they want (and are able) too.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7845]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Adults with capacity:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7846]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>You must also consider:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7847]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Whether women lake of capacity is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Temporary or permanent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7848]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Which procedure/ option would provide overall clinical benefit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7849]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Which option, including the option not to treat, would be least restrictive for future choices.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7850]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Advance decision/  Advance directive:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7851]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reflects a pt’s wish to refuse a particlar type of medical treatment or care if they become unable to make or communicate decision themselves.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7852]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If valid for current situation =&gt; must be respected.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7853]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Verbal:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7854]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Infront of chaperone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7855]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Must be documented.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7856]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Example:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7857]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breast examination.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7858]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Presence of students during surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7859]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Emergency procedures – CS, Assisted vaginal delivery 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> degree perineal tear (3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 4</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> written if time allows).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7860]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Em – LSCS Assisted vaginal, 3</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><strong>rd</strong></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>/4</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><strong>th</strong></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  degree =&gt; Better</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To go for written if time allows.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7862]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Written:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7863]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OPD procedures in Gynae.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7864]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Any procedure under local, regional or GA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7865]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Multimedia Images:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7866]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Laparoscopic findings, USG pictures, X – ray for teaching.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7867]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Removal of tissue for research/ testing where samples are not anonymized.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7868]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Example: Mrs X Histopath.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7869]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analysis of fetus following fetal loss after 24weeks of gestation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7870]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Storing gamets – legal advice HFEA &amp; written Consent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7871]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Consent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> no</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ta</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> Needed:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7872]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7873]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Images storing for pt record.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7874]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specific </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for removal of tissue for H/P is not required (unless anonymized and used in re</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cord</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; residual sample).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7875]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Retained tissues for education/ Teaching.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7876]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Unexpected Pathology:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7877]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexpected pathology related to complaints.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7878]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment can be performed (Appendicitis – I/O torsion).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7879]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Complication of surgery that is life threatening proceed with corrective surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7880]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexpected pathology not related to complaint.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7881]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t proceed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> like pain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> R</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iF – operated for appendicitis, I/O ovarian cyst =&gt; don’t remove</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7882]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexpected pathology – Biopsy can be taken if it doesn’t upstage the disease.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7883]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexpected Ectopic – remove.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7884]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexpected I/U pregnancy – reschedule operation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7885]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7886]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Obstetrics:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7887]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>During pain – no </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7888]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> between contractions or epidur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al =&gt; can give </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7889]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sterilization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> not be taken during labor or S/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7890]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If already signed during antenatal Period =&gt; can be performed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7891]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Gillick Competent:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7892]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 16 years’ may wish to give their Consent for treatment without parent’s knowledge =&gt; mature Minor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7893]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refusal of Treatment: Overridden Parental Consent or court orders.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7894]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Professional Translator:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7895]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If Pt not knows English, but should not be a relative.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7896]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gillick competent =&gt; TOP can be performed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7897]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fraser</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> law</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7898]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Covers </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contracepation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in mature minors</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7899]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Important Points:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7900]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All women age 18 or over =&gt; Capacity to give Consent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7901]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pt can withdraw Consent @ any time if so, procedures should be stopped as soon as possible.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7902]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No body can Consent for a person who has capacity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7903]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent does not expire.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7904]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent must be written only when the law require it.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7905]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No place in law for next of kin to give Consent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7906]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doctor must act only in best interest of women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7907]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7908]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Unconsious Pt:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7909]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doctor in best interest.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7910]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refusal of blood by Jehovah’s witness – don’t give blood.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7911]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fetus in context of </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Consent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7912]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetus has no rights.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7913]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women wishes =&gt; Respect her wishes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7914]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Newborn has own rights.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7915]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Motogomery Rulling:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7916]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doctors advisry role involves dialogue, The aim of which is to ensure that the pt understands the seriousness of her condition and anticipated benfits and risks of proposed treatmen and any reasonable alterative so that she can make an informed decision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7917]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Wound infection – need to be informed by doctor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7918]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bolam Test:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Which asks whether a doctor’s </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Consent would</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> be supported by a </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>reasonable body</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of medical opinion no longer applies to issues of consent, The law now requires a doctor to take </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reasonable care to ensure that the pt is aware of any material risk involved in any recommended treatment and of any reasona</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>le alter</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ati</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>v</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e or variant treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Example:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7921]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Necrotizing Fasciatu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s after C/S (rare complications).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7922]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bolam Principle Update:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7923]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doctor must ask themselves 3 Questions</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7924]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pt knows about Material risk of treatment I am proposing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7925]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pt knows reasonable alternatives.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7926]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I have taken reasonable care to ensure that pt actually knows this.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bolitho Modification:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Court is not bound to hold that practice is acceptable by virtue of a reasonable body of expert opinion whick supports it.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7929]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Caldicott Principles:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7930]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Justify the purpose for using confidential information.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7931]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t use personal confidential data unless it is absolutely necessary.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7932]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use minimal necessary confidential data.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7933]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Access to personal confidential data should be on strictly need to know basis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7934]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Everyone with access to personal confidential data should be aware of their responsibilities.</span></p>
