<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not able to understand, re</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tain ad weigh</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> the relevant information.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not able to communicate decision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>No</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Maximize capacity</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Improve ment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al condition.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bring in carer to help rely information.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Simple language.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Leaflets/ drawings.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Yes</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent to treat</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Requesting treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refusal of treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7991]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Advance Directive (AD)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Up to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> date.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specific to situation.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Made when pt has capacity.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signed &amp; witnessed.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If treatment refused AD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>must have included phrases</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>“</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Even</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> if my life @ risk”.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7993]"> </p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-001-1', 't-mm-06-001', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[7994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Lasting power of </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Att</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>orney</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Registered with public office of guardian.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Proxy consent and refusal both are valid.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LPA revoked if done not acting in best interest of pt.</span></p>
