<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Disagreement between </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8003]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>donee</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> &amp; practioner</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>best interest:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pt’s view.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Family discussion.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Review Pt’s previous/ future wishes.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider family review but it is not determined.</span></p>
