<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8128]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If &gt; 2cm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8129]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>S/C drains</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> NR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8130]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>U/A PH</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all C/S due to suspected fetal compromise.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8131]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A/B Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8132]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before skin incision (R).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8133]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post OP A/B That r ef</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fective against UTI, Endomertritis and woun</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d infectious =&gt; 8% risk after C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8134]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t give Amoxiclave</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before skin incision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8135]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><em><strong>st</strong></em></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> line:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8136]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cefuroxime 1.5g I/V sta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8137]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Metronidazole 500mg I/V sta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8138]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before cord clamping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8139]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><em><strong>nd</strong></em></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> line:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8140]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cli</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>da</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mycin 600mg I/V + sta</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8141]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre cord clamping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Extended prophylaxis </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>NR</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pae</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>diatrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should be available</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @ C/S  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If there is fetal compromise or G.A is given.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thermal care</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> R</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Skin to skin contact</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> R</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.F recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> as soon as possible.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8148]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Care after C/S:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HDU need 9/1000 women with C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 – 1 monitoring until regained airway control and haemodynamic stability and pt is able to communicate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Monitoring:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HR, RR, B.P, Pain, Sedation, O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Saturation ½ hourly till satisfactory/ stable.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Intrathecal </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>op</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>o</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ids</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Saturation, RR, Sedation, Pain Score, - 1 hourly till:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Morphine – 24 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diamorphine – 12 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Epidur</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>al </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Opioids</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>/ PCA:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hourly throughout treatment (RR, Sedation, Pain score).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 hours after discontinuation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Pain Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8161]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diamorphine</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8162]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intrathecal – 300ug.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8163]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural – up to 3ug.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If diamorphine is not available than use:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8165]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intrathecal preservative free morphine (up to 100mg).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidermal preservative free morphine (up to 3mg).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8167]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDS if no C/I.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8168]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral Morphine sulphate – risk of nausea.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8169]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V PCA using morphine + hourly monitoring of SATS, RR, Sedation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8170]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Paracetamol </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8171]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Di</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hydrocod</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ei</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8172]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Co  dydramol.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8173]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tram</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oxycodeine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> at lowest effective dose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8174]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Eating/ Drinking when hungry or thirsty who r well.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8175]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Catheter after 12 hours of spinal or top up dose of epidural.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8176]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resp Physiotherapy: NR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8177]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital stay:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8178]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NVD 1 – 2 D.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8179]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/S 3 – 4 D.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8180]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discharge after 24 hours if well.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8181]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regular analgesia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8182]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8183]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Woun</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>d Care:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8184]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Remove dressing after 6 – 24 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8185]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever monitoring.</span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-002-1', 't-mm-06-002', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8186]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment regarding signs of infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8187]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Loose clothing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8188]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Washing and drying daily.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8189]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Negative pressure dressing if BMI &gt; 35 Kg/m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>2</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8190]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post OP urinary symptoms:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8191]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Due to:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8192]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UTI 1%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8193]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SUI 4%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Injuries of U</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rinar</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Tract 1/1000 C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8195]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##4472C4; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urinary retention.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post Op Bleeding</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heavy/ irregular due to endometritis less likely RPOC</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8198]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Resumptio</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>n</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> of Activities</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (physical, sexual, exercise)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>once recovered from C/S.</span></p>
