<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Septic </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>unstable</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stabilize + conservative treatment.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specific treatment after patient is fit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Uncomplicated:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intervention</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> radiologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P/C drainage +</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nephrostomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sten</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ts + Bladder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>drainage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8466]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8467]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8468]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8469]"> </p>
