<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Haemoptysis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9204]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Signs:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9206]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tachycardia </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tachypnoea</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9208]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low SPO</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9209]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low grade pyrexia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9210]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ECG changes (S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>1</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Q</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>) Non specific</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9211]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Plueral rub</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9212]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fine crepitation @ base of lu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ngs</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9213]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9214]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9215]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Emergency with high mortality</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9216]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ICU admission</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9217]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT involvement </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9218]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full anticoagulation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9219]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Understanding of recurrent factor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9220]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Tahoma", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>17.6. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Tahoma", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>SEPSIS:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9221]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital acquired infection 7%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9222]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Upto 15% in low and middle income countries</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9223]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sepsis six</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9224]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9225]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9226]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Same as other patients</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9227]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Broad spectrum antibiotics, Gentamicin is considered useful.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9228]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Genital sepsis is polymicobial infection</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9229]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Liasie with microbiologist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9230]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Follow up treatment according to culture and sensitivities.</span></p>', 0);

