<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9232]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can form in pouch of dou</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>glas</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9233]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can vary in size and symptoms</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9234]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9235]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>History + examination</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9236]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominopelvic USG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9237]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominopelvic CT scan</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9238]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9239]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1. </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Medical:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9240]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rule out sepsis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9241]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antibiotics to small abscess</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9242]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> Needle drainage:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9243]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Percutaneous drainage by intervention radiologist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9244]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can be performed abdominally or vaginally depending upon location</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9245]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital stay</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9246]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Morbidit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>y</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9247]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Microscopy, cultur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e and sensitivity of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> p</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ulant content improve overall management.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9248]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediately effective if successful</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9249]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9250]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>3. </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Surgical Management:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9251]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Either open or laproscopy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9252]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Surgical treatment is considered </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>where medical treatment has fail</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed and intervention radiology is not available.</span></p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-06-024';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-024-0', 't-mm-06-024', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-06-024" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9253]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>17.8. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>AN</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>ESTHESIA COMPLICATION:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9254]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post dural puncture headache, commonest complication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9255]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fronteal headache</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9256]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe in intensity</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9257]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Postural and relived by lying down </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9258]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>meningitis should be ruled out</span></p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-06-025';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-025-0', 't-mm-06-025', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-06-025" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9259]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>17.9. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>VISCERAL INJURIES:</span></p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-06-026';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-026-0', 't-mm-06-026', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-06-026" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9260]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>17.9.1. URINARY TRACT:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9261]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common visceral injury in gynaecological surgery is to the bladder, Dome is most commonly involved.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9262]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ureteric damage in gynaecological surguries = 0.5 – 2.5%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9263]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In endometriosis surgery = 65% damage to ureter and 5.6% ureteric stenosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9264]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common sites of damage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9265]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Angle of vagina</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9266]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Near pelvic brim close to ovarian blood supply.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9267]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Signs and symptoms of urinary tract damage:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9268]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persistant loin pain.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9269]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Poor urine output despite ruling out other conditions</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9270]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood stained or clear fluid in peritoneal drain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9271]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaginal leakage of urine</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9272]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urine draining abdominally</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9273]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9274]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Signs and symptoms of Urinary tract o</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>c</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>culsion:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9275]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Loin pain – may not be as severe as anticipated and may settle with NSAID.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9276]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oliguria (in case of bilateral)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9277]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persistant haematuria</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9278]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pyrexia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9279]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Investigations:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9280]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood test, RFT’S to rule out kidney damage </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9281]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ultrasound – dilated ureters in occulsion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IVU – details of level of block</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9283]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 swab test – VVF</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9284]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cytoscopy = VVF and occulsion of terminal ureter</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9285]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stenting + radio – opaque dye – demonstrate in ureter.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Seek a urologists help.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Uretric Injury:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9289]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ pelvic brim – end to end anastomosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9290]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ bladder edge – reimplantation into bladder using p</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oas</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hitch or bladder flap</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to relive tension on repair.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9291]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fistula:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9292]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediate af</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ter surgery – repair + cathetriz</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ation </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9293]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Small leakage pos</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t op = cathertriz</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ation 7 – days and manage conservatively</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9294]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delayed repair – if fistula appears late.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9295]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adequate mobilization of fistula</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Triming of edges or debridment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repair in 2 layers can be done in 1 layer</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9298]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>absorbable</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sutures.</span></p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-06-027';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-06-027-0', 't-mm-06-027', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-06-027" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9299]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>17.9.2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>Bowel complications:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9300]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Relatively rare</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Paralytic ilues:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9302]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commonest bowel complication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manipulation of small bowel during surery diminishes bowel activity for 16 hours, Failure to return to normal activity will result in paralytic ilues</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9304]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Signs and symptoms:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nausea</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9306]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vomiting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominal distention</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9308]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unable to tolerate fluids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9309]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delayed passage of flatus and stool</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9310]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>On examination</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9311]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bowel sounds quiet or reduced</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9312]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>X – ray abdomen</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9313]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dilated bowel loops</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9314]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9315]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9316]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Always managed conservatively</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9317]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NPO to rest the bowels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9318]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fluid replacement</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9319]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nasogestric tube dr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ainage once ileus is confirmed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9320]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>intake when there is evidance of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> return of bowel function</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9321]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Start oral intake gradually</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9322]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Bowel obstruction:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9323]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rare complication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9324]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Become appara</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> untill day 5 post op</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9325]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Clinical picture</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9326]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persistent vomiting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9327]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominal disten</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominal pain </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signs of peritonism</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9330]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>X – ray:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reveals dilated bowel loop</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Air fluid levels</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9333]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9334]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9336]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Signs of peritonism or</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Despite conservative treatment</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persistent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> vomiting</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High volume NG aspirate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Minimal passage of flatus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prolong duration</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>surgery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>No Peritonis</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>m</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NPO</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NG tube</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9340]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V fluids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9341]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mostly resolves </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9342]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in 48 – 72 hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9343]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fail</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed conservative</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>measures</span></p>
