<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9356]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''>17.9.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''>4</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''>. ACUTE COLONIC PSEUDO – OBSTRUCTION (ACPO) AFTER C/S:</span></p>
