<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9434]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CXR:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Gas under diaphram</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9435]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>AXR: </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Cecal dilation</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span></p>
