<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9442]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ACPO – 46%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9443]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Difference between ACPO and Mechanical obstrution:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9444]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contrast enema F/B </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A x R</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9445]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CT – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9446]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(CT with contrast abdominal + pelvic)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9447]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cecal diameter &gt; 14cm indicative of perforation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9448]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9449]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Conservative 24 – 48 hours</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9450]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NPO</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correction of S/E</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9453]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fluid correction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9454]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mobilization</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9455]"> </p>
