<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cecal diameter    ing or static</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9458]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9459]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical Treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Medical treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neostigmine – 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.5mg over 5 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat after 3 hours if no response</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>S/E:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9466]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vomiting bronchspasm, Brady cardia hypotension, excessive salivation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9467]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9468]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unsuccessful</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9469]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Endoscopy:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9470]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Colonoscopy </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> placement of rectal tube</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9471]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cecal diameter 9 – 12cm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9472]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>61 – 95% success</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9473]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrance – 40%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9474]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Percutaneus cecostomy – cecal tube percutenuously.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9475]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Surgical treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9476]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Indications:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9477]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed medical</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9478]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed decompression</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9479]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ischemia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9480]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Perforation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9481]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>17.9.</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>4</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>. </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>BOWEL INJURY:</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9482]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>0.3 – 0.8%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9483]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>70% injuries are minor laceration</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9484]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>75% injuries involve small bowel</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9485]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early recognition – good out</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9486]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delayed presentation with peritonism – high morbidity and mortality.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9487]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Presentation:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9488]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Majority are identified @ the time of operation and carry good outcome</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9489]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Late presentation can be lethal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9490]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9491]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abdominal pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9492]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vomiting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9493]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tender abdomen </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9494]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signs of peritonism</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9495]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signs of sepsis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9496]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9497]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Opinion and input of surgeon</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9498]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Small injuries like puncture with needle heals spontenously, it leaks only in case of distel obstruction.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9499]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9500]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>17.9.</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>5</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>. </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>FECAL FISTULA</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9501]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Common site of large bowel injury – sigmoid colon and rectum.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9502]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Risk factors:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9503]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hystrectomy with scarring or obliterated pouch of douglas</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9504]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometriosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9505]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pelvic dense adhesions</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9506]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9507]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Speculum examination</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9508]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gastograffin enema – to localize the bowel defect</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9509]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9510]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Colorectal surgeron’s input</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9511]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Small fistula heals by proximal defunctioning colostomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9512]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Large fistula require surgical correction by resection of affected bowel.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>17.9.</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>6</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>. </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: lightGray''><em>DUTY OF CANDOUR:</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical professionals have a duty to be open and honest with patients when things go wrong.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Health and social care Act 2008</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9516]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regulation 20 is duty of candour</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intention is to ensure that providers are open and transparent with people who use services and other relevant persons in general in relation to care and treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9518]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>It also sets out some specific requirements that providers must follow when things go wrong with care and treatment, providing reasonable support, providing truthful information and an apology when things go wrong</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9519]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>The regulation applies to registered persons when they are carrying on regulated activity</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9520]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5. Breach in this duty can lead to prosecution by the care quality commission (CQC).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9521]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9522]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9523]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9524]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9525]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9526]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9527]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9528]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9529]"> </p>', 0);

