<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 50pt''><em><strong>EARLY PREGNANCY CARE</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9769]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9770]"> </p>
