<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9804]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>RECURRENT PREGNANCY LOSS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9805]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>ECTOPIC PREGNANCY</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9806]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>DIAGNOSIS OF INTRAUTERINE AND ECTOPIC PREGNANCY</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9807]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>GESTATIONAL TROPHOBLASTIC DISEASES (GTD) </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9808]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>5. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>MANAGEMENT OF NAUSEA AND VOMITING IN PREGNANCY AND HYPEREM</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>ESIS   GRAVIDARUM</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9809]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>6. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>EVOLUTION IN SCREENING FOR DOWN SYNDROME + CFFDNA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9810]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>7. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>AMNIOCENTESIS AND CVS</span></p>
