<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9983]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9984]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9985]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9986]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9987]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Tests to </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>be </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>carried out</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> in all women with RPL</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> (1</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>st </strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong> </strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>recurrent / </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>nd</strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> only 1 miscarriage</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>):</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>APLA – if +ve =&gt; LMWH + Aspirin in next pregnancy once UPT +ve.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Genetic tests </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Parental. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Protein S, Factor V (2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>) &amp; PT gene mutation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3D USG – for uterine anomalies</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9995]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI and endoscopy in case of inconclusive diagnosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TPO +</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> TSH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9998]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[9999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>From 7 – 9 weeks till 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10000]"> </p>
