<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10237]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Referral to FMU for invasive testing and karyotyping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10238]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> molar </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> viable fetus.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10239]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnostic doubt. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10240]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rule out partial mole.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10241]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Placental Hyperplasia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10242]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Counselling regarding perinatal mortality.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10243]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Risks in Twin Molar:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10244]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early fetal loss – 40%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10245]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PTB – 36%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10246]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PE – 20%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10247]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  Babies surviving 51%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10248]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No maternal death</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10249]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>no </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>increased</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> need for chemo.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10250]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>     </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PSTT, ETT</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> referral to GTD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Centre</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
