<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10395]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigation:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dipstick</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nitrate shows infection</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MSU</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urea/Electrolyte</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypo/Kalemia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyponatremia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypochloremi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>alkalosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CBC</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Infection TLC</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT - raised</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anemia </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BSR</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – rule out DKA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirm viable pregnancy.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exclude multiple &amp; molar pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Refractory cases:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TFTS 2/3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> have abnormal TFTS.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LFTS 40% of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NVP</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>have abnormal LFTS, most commonly transaminases </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ca</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lcium </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>phosphate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amylase</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, to exclude pancreatitis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ABG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to exclude metabolic disturbance.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>History:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>previous NVP, HG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PUQE score</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/ HELP score</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exclude</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pancreatitis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UTI, other infections</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>chronic H </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pylori</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> infection. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>epigastric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pain is unusual – rule out other cases.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endoscopy </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>safe.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rule out comorbidities</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>D/</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>D:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cholecystitis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pancreatitis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UTI, pyelonephritis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hepatitis </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drug </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>induced</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neurological conditions</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Examination:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pulse</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Temp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>R/R</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sa</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dehydration signs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Muscle wasting</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weight</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs examination</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neurological signs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Malnutrition signs</span></p>
