<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10449]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pyridoxine N</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OT recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10450]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid – where std therapies fails.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diazepam – NR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ginger – in mild – moderate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>who</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> wish to avoid antiemetics.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10453]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Accus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>timulation safe &amp; improve NVP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10454]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypn</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>osis – NR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Extrapyramidal S/E – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with metoclopramide and phenothiazine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(slow</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> I/V injection over 3 min)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10456]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Combination is offered if no response to one drug</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>I/V </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Antiemetic</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>s:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>After specialist advice</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10459]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>In the following patients:</em></span></p>
