<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>HG increases</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> risks </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>n</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> followings:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DM</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10466]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gastric band</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10467]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gastric bypass</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10468]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gastric sleeve surgery</span></p>
