<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10470]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fluids:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10471]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal saline 9% with KC</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>L guided by S/E monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10472]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dextrose infusions avoided until</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10473]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/Na</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - is normal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10474]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thiamine replaced.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10475]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>It can precipitate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Warnicke</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> encephalopathy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10476]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Appropriate for NV in 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trimester to treat and prevent starvation ketosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10477]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Monitoring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10478]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urea/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Electrolytes daily who require I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/V fluids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10479]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Supportive Therapies:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10480]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Antagonists or PPI =&gt; in GERD, esophagitis, Gastritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10481]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thiamine </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10482]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hiamine: dose 100mg, P/O, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>three times a day</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or I/V pabrinex as part of B – complex</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10483]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Indications</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of thiamine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10484]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before dextrose</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10485]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before parental Nutrition.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10486]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>all women admitted with vomiting.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10487]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severely</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> reduced </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dietary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> intake</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10488]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10489]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Thromboprophylaxis</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>–</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> LMWH</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10490]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Those who are managed in community setting should be assessed for risk of </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>V</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>TE</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10491]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Discontinue thromboprophylaxis upon discharge or continue if there is any other indication</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10492]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>   </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Iron</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> avoid if they cause exacerbation of symptoms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10493]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Laxatives</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: if constipated or using </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ondansetron</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10494]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complications &amp; t/m:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10495]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>GRED – Gastroscopy is safe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PPI</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can be used</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10496]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>WER</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>NICKES</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> encephalopathy</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – reversible</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, potentially fatal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> medical – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>emergency </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>1</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> deficiency. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10497]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Symptoms</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = confusion, memory loss, drows</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iness, Blurred vision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10498]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>O/E</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = Nystagmus, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ophthalmoplegia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Hypo/Areflexia, Finger nose ataxia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10499]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In HG there is episodic and slow onset.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10500]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Effect of NVP and HG on Mental Health:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10501]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre – existing conditions are exacerbated particularly with HG where prescribed medication is not kept down</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10502]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HG is a risk factor or PSTD, PND anxiety.</span></p>
