<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10657]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>placental mosaicism =&gt; false positive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10658]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maternal cancers =&gt; false positive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10659]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Inconclusive results:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10660]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.9 – 6.4%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10661]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contingent screening:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10662]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line screening test </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>done </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in high risk &gt; 1:150.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10663]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fewer DS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> detected.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10664]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fewer procedure related loss.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10665]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fewer invasive procedure from 10 – 2.8/trisomy 21.</span></p>
