<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10668]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>7. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong> AMNIOCENTESIS &amp; CVS:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10669]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5% women require invasive Tests or 300,000/Anum.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10670]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10671]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><u><strong> Amniocentesis</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>: </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Most common</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10672]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 15weeks </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7.1% loss rate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>increased</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>isk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>talipes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
