<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Late</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 15 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0.5% loss rate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10678]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>trimester</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10679]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not associated with early deliver</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>y</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bloody tap 5 – 10% </span></p>
