<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10742]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ue to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> bowel puncture, skin contaminated, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gel or probe.</span></p>
