<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10969]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Partner has </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>hemoglobinopathy</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10970]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ICSI/IVF, PGD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10971]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Donor Egg/sperm =&gt; Genetic screening for hemoglobinopathy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before donation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10972]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Vaccination / Antibiotic prophylaxis.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10973]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaccination</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> against</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> encapsulated bacteria:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10974]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hep B – all pts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10975]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pneumococcus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10976]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HiB</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Every 5 years.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10977]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Meningococcus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10978]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntibiotic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - penicillin </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prophylaxis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> along</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with vaccination case of splenectomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10979]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ANC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10980]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monthly antenatal visits till 28 weeks, 2 weekly later.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10981]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Routine as well as specialist care.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10982]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>DM</em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – Monthly Fructosamine + specialist diabetic review.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>Cardiac assessment</em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @ 28 weeks – all women with Echo:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI =&gt; in pts wo have not received Pre conception assessment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypothyroid – TFT – periodically.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>USG</em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7 – 9 weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for fetal viability as they have </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>risk of miscarriage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Booking </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/dating @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>11 – 14 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anomaly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 18 – 21 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Serial Biometry 4 weekly from 24 weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(IUGR).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>Transfusion in </em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>thalassemia</em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em> major</em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Generally,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ransfusion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> regimen </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>remains</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stable</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>target HB 100g/l. (pre – Transfusion).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Transfusion in thalassemia intermedia</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Transfusion if:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Worsening anemia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUGR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target Hb = same as non-pregnant</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[10999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal growth and low Hb =&gt; Formulated plan of t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ransfusion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb check every 2 – 3 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11001]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Thromboprophylaxis:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Splenectomy OR </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Plt</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt;600 xO</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>9</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; Aspirin 75s.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11003]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Splenectomy + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Plt</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt;600 xO</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>9</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; Aspirin + LMWH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital Admission – LMWH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11005]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery by SVD – LMWH during admission + 7 days after discharge.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11006]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cs – LMWH 6 weeks after birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11007]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Iron Chelation During Pregnancy.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11008]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Managed by haematologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11009]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Myocardial Iron:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11010]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Checked r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>egularly in women with cardiac Iron Overload </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>(</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>risk of Cardiac </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Decompensation</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11011]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> MRI &lt;20 MS -&gt; S/C </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>deferoxamine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20mg/kg/day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11012]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 – 5 days/ week.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11013]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>From 20 – 24 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11014]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Signs of cardiac decomposition &amp; indication for iron chelation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;20 =&gt; No need unless    ed hepatic Iron load.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11015]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Falling EF =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deferoxamine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Increasing Ventricular Volume:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- cardiac decompensation in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; adverse outcome.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11019]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hepatic Iron:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11020]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 15mg/g – low dose Iron chelation from 20 weeks.</span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-08-001-1', 't-mm-08-001', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11021]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>I</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ntra</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>partum</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11022]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery according to obstetric indication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11023]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cross matching for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>presence</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntib</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>odies </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11024]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Grouping is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11025]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deferoxamine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2g/24 hours</span></p>
