<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11064]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>A</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ntibiotic</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> prophylaxis</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> penicillin/Erythromycin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11065]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>V</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>accination –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Neisseria Me</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ningiti</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>des, S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>trept</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pneumonia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, HIB, He</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>p</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> B </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Swine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>flu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – yearly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11066]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>5</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>m</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>g F.A in pregnancy –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1mg out site the pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11067]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Hydroxycarbamide –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Stop 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11068]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Teratogenic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>effects </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>–</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> level 3 USG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>conceived</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>With</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydroxycarbamide</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> but</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Termination </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is not recommended unless anomaly is confirmed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11069]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ANC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11070]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT (OBS, Midwife, Haematologist).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11071]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical review if not done before.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11072]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid preci</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tating Factors.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11073]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HIB vaccination.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11074]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntibiotic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> prophylaxis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11075]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Iron (orally if deficiency) Iron status checked regularly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11076]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low dose aspirin from 12 weeks to reduce PE</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all Pts</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with SCD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11077]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH during hospital stay.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11078]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urinalysis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> on each visit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11079]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urine C/s – Monthly    </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11080]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDS as</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>relief can</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> be given in between</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 12 – 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11081]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>USG:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11082]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7 – 9 weeks – fetal viability.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11083]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>11 – 14 weeks – Dating</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> scan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11084]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20 weeks – Anomaly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> scan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11085]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 weekly from 24 weeks – Growth Scan.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11086]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Transfusion: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11087]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Routinely not done.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11088]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transfusion only if Hb &lt;6 or 2g drop from baseline.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11089]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Types of TX in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sickle</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cell disease</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11090]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Exchange Tx:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11091]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute stroke.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11092]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute chest syndrome ACS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11093]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Top – Up Tx:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11094]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute anemia HB &lt;6 OR 2g drop from baseline</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11095]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Prophylactic Tx:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11096]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Twins.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11097]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>risk of painful crises so should not be given routinely.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11098]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11099]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Already on Tx =&gt; continue same regimen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11100]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>F</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ull blood count at</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20, 24, 28, 32 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks (1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> monthly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11101]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Alloimmunization = 18 – 36%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11102]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>I/P Care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11103]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Elective birth @ 38 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11104]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   ed risk of Acs, acute sickling crises in labor – more in prolong labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11105]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood cross match – if Atypical Ab are present.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11106]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital birth – More risk of C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11107]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep warm and hydrated </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11108]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> set &gt; 94%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11109]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CEFM </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>recommended because of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    ed risk of: </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11110]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUGR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11111]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11112]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low threshold for intrapartum antibiotics.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11113]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid Pethidine, other opioids are safe</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11114]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regional </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11115]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid GA – 25% more in risk of crises in GA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11116]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11117]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11118]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PNC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11119]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testing of baby (if partner is carrier or affected).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11120]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sat &gt; 94%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11121]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11122]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SVD – Hospital stay + 7 days’ post discharge.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11123]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CS – 6 weeks post-natal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11124]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stocking are recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11125]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.F is safe avoided dehydration</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11126]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contraception:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11127]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line – Progesterone containing POP, IUS, DMPA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>less painful crises</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with DMPA)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11128]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line – Estrogen containing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11129]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acute painful Crises: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11130]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>25 – 50% during pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11131]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgency – Rapid assessment most frequent complication.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11132]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low threshold for presentation to hospital.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11133]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11134]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11135]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Midwife</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11136]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anesthetist</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11137]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Haematologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11138]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analgesia - avoid </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pethidine (risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>seizures</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>) </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11139]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11140]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Initial Analgesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should be given within</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 30 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11141]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effective </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>analgesia </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>within 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hour.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fluid 60ml / kg / 24hrs </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub> sats </sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, RR, sedation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> level</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> every 20 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all women</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDs between 12 – 28 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Morphine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> severe pain (RR &lt;10 – omit)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Therapeutic </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>antibiotics if needed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11148]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11149]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Acute Complications:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ACS –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>most common </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>7 – 20%</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after painful crises</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Symptoms:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chest pain like pneumonia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H1N1</span>­<span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – similar picture so </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rule</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> out H1N1 infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>S</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>troke </strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis C/I </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urgent exchange Tx.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Acute anemia –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> top up Tx </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &lt; 6.5, or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Saturation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Infection with Eryth</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>r</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ovirus –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Aplastic crises.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute anemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11161]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal hydrops – FMU review due to vertical trans</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mission.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11162]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11163]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acute painful Crises</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11165]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mild</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Moderate</strong></u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Severe</strong></u></span></p>', 0);
