<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11245]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Antenatal assessment and management </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11246]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>HIGH RISK</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Requires antenatal prophylaxes with LMWH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer to trust – nominated thrombosis in pregnancy expert/ team.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(to be assessed at booking and repeated</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11247]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any previous VTE except a single event related to major surgery. (4)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>If admitted).</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11248]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11249]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11250]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hospital admission </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Single previous VTE related to major surgery.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>High – risk thrombophilia + no VTE. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Medical comorbidities e.g. cancer, heart failure, active SLE, IBD or inflammatory polyarthropathy, nephrotic syndrome, type I DM with nephropathy, sickle cell disease, current IVDU. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any surgical procedure e.g. appendectomy. (3)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>OHSS (first trimester only). (4)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11251]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11252]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>INTEREDIATE RISK</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider antenatal prophylaxes with LMWH</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11253]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11254]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11255]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11256]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Obesity (BMI &gt; 30 kg/m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>2</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>. (½) </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Age &gt; 35. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Parity </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> 3. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Smoker. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Gross varicose veins. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Current pre – eclampsia. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Immobility, e.g. paraplegia, PGP. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Family history of provoked or estrogen – provoked VTE in first – degree relative.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Low – risk thrombophilia PT Gene, f – V heterozygous obs APLA.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Multiple pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IVF/ ART.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Transient factors:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Dehydration/ hyperemesis: current systemic. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Infection: long – distance travel. (1)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hypere</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>me</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>sis. (3)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11257]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Four or more risk factors:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prophylaxes from first trimester.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Three risk factors:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prophylaxes from 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11258]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11259]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11260]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11261]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fewer than three risk factors </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11262]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11263]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11264]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>LOWER RISK</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mobilization and avoidance of dehydration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11265]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11266]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11267]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11268]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11269]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>APL = antiphospholipid antibodies (lupus anticoagulant, anticardiolipin antibodies, ẞ, -</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>glycoprotein 1 antibodies).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11270]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ART = assisted reproductive technolo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gy; BMI based on booking weight.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11271]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DM = diabetes mellitus.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11272]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FHx = family history; gross varicose veins - symptomatic, above knee or associated with phlebitis/oedema/skin changes; high-risk thrombophilia - antithrombin deficiency, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>protein C or S deficiency, compound or homozygous for low-risk thrombophilia’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11273]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IBD = inflammatory b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>owel disease.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11274]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immobility = 2 3 days.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11275]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IVDU = intravenous drug user.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11276]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IVF = in vitro fertilization.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11277]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = low-molecular-weight heparin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11278]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ng-distance travel = &gt; 4 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11279]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low-risk thrombophilia = heterozygous for factor V Leiden or prothrombin G20210A mutatio</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ns.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11280]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OHSS = ov</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>arian hyper stimulation syndrome.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11281]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PGP - pelvic girdle pain with reduced mobility</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> PPH = postpartum hemorrhage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11283]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>thromb</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ophilia = inherited or acquired.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11284]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VTE = venous thromboembolism.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11285]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Air Travel:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sto</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ckings</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with14 -15 mmhg for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 4 hours travel </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Warfarin:</strong></u></span></p>
