ottom:8pt;">90 – 109 </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:76.45pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">100mg/150mg</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:76.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">10,000/20,000</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:60.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:59.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">110 – 120 or more</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:76.45pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">120mg/180mg</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:76.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">120000/24000</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:60.8pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11496]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Targets:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11497]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Xa = 0.5 – 1IUml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11498]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T = 1.5 – 2.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11499]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>INR = 2 – 3.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11500]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PE (massive life threatening PE):</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11501]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11502]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UfH I/V:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11503]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Loading dose 80 unit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> maintenance</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 18iu/kg.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11504]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target APTT 1.5 – 2.5times.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11505]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>APTT – 4 – 6hrs after loading dose, 6 hours after any dose change.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11506]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>At least daily when therapeutic range is achieved.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11507]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring is difficult in late pregnancy due to   Fibrinogen   VIII</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11508]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11509]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Involve haematologist =&gt; Monitor x – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a (0.5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 1.0</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11510]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11511]"> </p>
