der-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 2         </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:92.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">- </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:55.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">6 hours</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:49.4pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">&gt;3.0</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:70.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 3         </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:92.15pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Stop infusion for 1 hr</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:55.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">6 hours</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11512]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Thrombolytic Therapy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Streptokinase </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>urokinase</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tissue plasminogen Activator.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11516]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of fetal/ Maternal bleeding.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In case of thrombolytic therapy don’t give loading dose of ufH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11518]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Graduat</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ed Elastic compression stockings</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11519]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Proximal DVT – Below knee.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11520]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>23mmHg.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11521]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Caval</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> Filters –</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> consider in 1 iliac vein thrombosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11522]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Labor and Delivery:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11523]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>LMWH</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11524]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stop 24 hours before C/S, Reginal Anaesthesia restart prophylactic dose after 4 hours and therapeutic dose after 8 – 12 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11525]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> ufH</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11526]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>S/C </em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>ufH</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>: Stop</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before 12 hours </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11527]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ufH:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stop before 6 hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11528]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Restart after 4 hrs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11529]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use of drains.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11530]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If there is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of PPH – ufH is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>preferred</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11531]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Natal:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11532]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe in B.F.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11533]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Start </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral Anticoagulants after 5 – 7 days (INR 2 – 3).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11534]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post thrombotic syndrome – 40%.</span></p>', 0);
