<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11619]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti D &gt; 4, Anti C &gt;7</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5, Any anti K.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11620]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Significant history of HDFN requiring exchange Tx, unexplained severe jaundice, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>titer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of &gt; 32.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11621]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rising </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>titer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11622]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG suggestive of fetal anemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11623]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Other than C, D, K (any </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>titer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11624]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA PSV &gt;1.5MOM | Signs of anemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11625]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Need for IUT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11626]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Causes of Alloimmunization</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11627]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>should be </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ascertained</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11628]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood Tx.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11629]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Inadequate Anti D/ omitted Anti D injections.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11630]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUT, exchange Tx, Severe </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>jaundice</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> requiring phototherapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11631]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MCA – PSV: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11632]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weekly by expert</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11633]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sensitivity 99%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11634]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>False positive 12%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11635]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sensitivity    after 36 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11636]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 1.5 MOM =&gt; referral to FMU for FBS – (loss rate = 1 – 3% FBS).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11637]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IUT:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11638]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O negative D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, K</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11639]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CMV negative.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11640]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Citrate phosphate dextrose. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11641]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 5 days old.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11642]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT = 0.70 – 0.85.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11643]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Irradiated within 24 hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11644]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ex</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>change</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Tx: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11645]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HCT 0.5 – 0.6.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11646]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Group specific.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11647]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ab negative, K</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11648]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CMV negative. &lt; 5 days old.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11649]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Irradiated.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11650]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Top – Up:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11651]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>35 days old.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11652]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non – irradiated.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11653]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Irradiation only if IUT </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>already </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>give</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11654]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>High Risk women </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>for</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Tx:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11655]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weekly cross matching.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11656]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sample should not be &gt;12hrs old.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11657]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Used</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- same group ABO.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11658]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- same Rh D.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>During</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11659]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>For </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- CMV negative.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pregnancy </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11660]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tx </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Kel Negative.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11661]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Life Threatening, Haemorrhage =&gt; Transfuse blood + 1g prednisolone + full </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>resuscitation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11662]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Anti D Prophylaxis:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11663]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rh D Negative women:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11664]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti D Ab – NO prophylaxis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11665]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non-Anti</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> D Ab – Give prophylaxis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11666]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Intrapartum care</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11667]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CEFM</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11668]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In stable Ab levels and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>normal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fetal tests =&gt; routine obstetric care.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11669]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High risk Ab but no fetal anemia =&gt; 37 – 38weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11670]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Earlier if IUT done </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>delivery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11671]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11672]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver in unit where facilities of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>exchange</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Tx are available.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regular Hb and Bilirubin monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regular neurological assessment – sensorineural hearing loss, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>kernicterus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid dehydration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11678]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Need for phototherapy/ Exchange Tx.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11679]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neonatal Anemia:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>due to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> maternal Ab – hemolysis </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11681]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Late due to suppression of Erythropoiesis esp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecially</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in IUT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11682]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11683]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Top – up Tx (if symptomatic).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11684]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Role of erythropoietin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11685]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>long-term</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> consequences of Ab on women health but an antibody card should be carried in case of transfusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11686]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11687]"> </p>
