<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11835]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Teenage pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11836]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Significant bleeding history.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11837]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ferritin is must</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:   </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>with normal Hb</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11838]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of Hge.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11839]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Jehovah’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> witness.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11840]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Where compatible blood is a challenge.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11841]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11842]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral iron:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11843]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anemia 100 – 200mg/day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11844]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non anemic iron deficiency 40 – 65mg/day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11845]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat Testing 2 – 3 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11846]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expected rise 20g/l in 3 – 4 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11847]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11848]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb (N) continue for</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb still low =&gt; Check</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11849]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 months </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>compliance &amp; non iron</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11850]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(or at least 6 weeks PP).</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>deficiency.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11851]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11852]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Medical </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>evaluation:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11853]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>indications</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11854]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &lt;7 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> symptoms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11855]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advance Gestation &gt; 34weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11856]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No response on 2 – 3 weeks’ oral iron Therapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11857]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ferrous </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>form is </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pref</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>err</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ed</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11858]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 hour before meal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11859]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ferric: less Gi – Upset.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11860]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Parental Iron:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sucrose, and carboxymaltose – same result.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11862]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>C/I:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11863]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11864]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>S/E:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11865]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Malaise.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11866]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypothermia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11867]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pain.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11868]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nausea, vomiting</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11869]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Arthralgia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11870]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rise in Hb – 7 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11871]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Indications</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11872]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &lt;10 after 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11873]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Poor compliance.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11874]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No response to oral therapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11875]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11876]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Blood Tx:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11877]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Limited</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recommendations</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> due to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>antibodies</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and HDFN.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11878]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PP – anemia:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11879]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood loss &gt;500ml during delivery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11880]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>check</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11881]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hb within 48 hours</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11882]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11883]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Oral iron</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>parenteral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> Iron</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11884]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If Hb &lt;10 Asymptomatic</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Symptomatic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11885]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Or mild symptoms.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Intolerant women.</span></p>
