<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11887]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &lt;10 in antenatal period =&gt; delivery in obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> unit.</span></p>
