<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11900]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>8. H</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>YPERTENTION</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong> IN PREGNANCY</strong></span></p>
