<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11905]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Ch</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ronic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> HTN</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- BMI &gt;35</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11906]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- DM 1, 2.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Inter pregnancy</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>interval &gt; 10years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11907]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- SLE.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Family history of P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>E</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11908]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- APLS.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Multiple pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11909]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- CKD.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11910]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Proteinur</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>i</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>a:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11911]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dipstick screening:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11912]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;1 + =&gt; Quantification.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11913]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11914]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Albumin/ creatinine ratio </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>protein/ creatinine ratio </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11915]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>P.E:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>8mg/mmol </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>30</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11916]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Don’t use morning void urine.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11917]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''><u><strong>Chronic HTN:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11918]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre – pregnancy counselling – stop ACE, inhibitors, ARB, Thiazides, diuretics.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advice: healthy eating, exercise, weight, management and salt reduction.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ANC</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11921]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>Stop Anti Hypertensives </em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11922]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P &lt;110/70 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or symptomatic </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hypotension</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11923]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11924]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11925]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Offer Anti HTN: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11926]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P &gt;140/90 =&gt; Target 135/85.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer placental Growth factors PIGE testing between 20 – 35weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A/N Appointment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11929]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weekly – HTN uncontrolled.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11930]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2 – 4weeks for controlled B.P.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11931]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Timing of Birth:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11932]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P &lt;160/110 =&gt; after 37 weeks in collaboration with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obstetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11933]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PNC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11934]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: (target &lt;140/90)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11935]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2 days – daily.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11936]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Between 3 – 5 days – once.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11937]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 weeks – review by GP/Consultant.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11938]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6 – 8 weeks – review by GP/Consultant.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11939]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Clinical concerns:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11940]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P &gt; 160.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11941]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Creatinine &gt;1mg/mmol.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11942]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ALT &gt;70 Or twice upper (N).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11943]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PLT &lt;150,000.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11944]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signs of impending Eclampsia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11945]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Signs of Eclampsia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11946]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspected fetal compromise</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11947]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11948]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11949]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11950]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11951]"> </p>
