00000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">B.P &gt; 150/100</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">B.P &lt; 130/80</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">*  48 – 72 hours after Birth.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Normal =&gt; no need to repeat.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">U/A: 6 – 8 weeks =&gt; repeat 3m0 Postnatal.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Target B. P</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">B.P &lt; 130/80</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">B.P &lt; 130/80</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Hematological Tests</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:107.9pt;border-top: