<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Women with</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> previous</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> History of:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe pre-eclampsia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PE resulted in Birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUGR &lt; 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer usg for EFW,AFI and umbilical artery doppler @between 28-30 weeks or 2 weeks before the previous event. Repeat after 4 weeks if results are normal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management in </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>critical</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> setting:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe HTN, severe Pre-eclampsia, history of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fits, planned</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> birth in 24 hours =&gt; I/V Mgso4</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Give Mgso4 in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pre-eclampsia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with any of following </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ongoing headache</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Visual scotoma.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12001]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nausea vomiting.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epigastric pain.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12003]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oliguria</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/ Severe HTN.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Progressive det</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erioration</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12005]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of lab tests.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12006]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Eclampsia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mgso4</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Loading</strong></u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4g I/V in 5 – 15 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12007]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Maintenance</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1g/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>hr.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>/24 hours of las</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>t </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>fit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12008]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Repeat fit</strong></u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 – 4g repeat Bolus.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12009]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12010]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Regional An</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>a</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>esthesia:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12011]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low dose epidural</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>don’t preload</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>severe PE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12012]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Combine spinal epidura</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12013]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Anti – Hypertensives:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12014]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>* </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ntenatal</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Period:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12015]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line – labetalol (C/I in Asthma).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nifedipine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (C/I with Mgso4).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line – Methyldopa, (C/I in PP</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> period</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>* </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>P</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ostnatal</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12019]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Enalapril – Breast Feeding friendly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12020]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nifedipine/amlodipine.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12021]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12022]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Combination of enalapril + Nifedipine.</span></p>
