<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12106]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In maternal Grand Father.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12107]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor VIII: VWF &lt;0.7 is suggestive of carriership</span></p>
