<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12109]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Mild:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> .06 – 0.40IU/ml</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>bleeding after</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12110]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Mod:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 0.01 – 0.5 </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>trauma</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12111]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Severe:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> &lt; 0.01 – spontaneous bleeding in Joints and muscles.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12112]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Carriers:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  risk of bleeding during invasive procedures, TOP, C/S, SVD when levels between 0.4 – 0.6.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12113]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonate</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>s:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Male at risk of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> ICH, ECH, iatrogenic h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>morrhage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12114]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pre – </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pregnancy Management:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12115]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitor levels before pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12116]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct weight and iron deficiency =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed bleeding risk.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12117]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Genetic counsel</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ling</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + genetic testing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of partner</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12118]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Written informed consent before genetic Testing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12119]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ANC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12120]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT management of pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12121]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>P</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>renatal diagnosis</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – all carriers of severe hemophilia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12122]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>9 weeks CFFDNA </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pts to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> determine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sex.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12123]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If male fetus then determine hemophilia status by</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12124]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CVS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>at</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>11 – 14</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12125]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amnio</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>centesis in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12126]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Male fetus – informed choices.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12127]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If PND not perform</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed – consider as affected fetu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12128]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor levels:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12129]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##EE0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Female gender</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check at booking, before invasive procedure and in 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  -</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Target – 0.5I/ml</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12130]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reatment </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is given then</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> target</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1U/ml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12131]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT includes neonatologist and obstetrician.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12132]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acute Bleeding:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12133]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tran</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>examic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acid</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> all women</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12134]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In combination o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>f</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> factor VIII if levels are</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt; 0.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12135]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Solely if &gt; 0.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12136]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in all procedures until Bleeding settles.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12137]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Desmopressin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> (DDAVP)</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12138]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DDAVP</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   level VIII but not IX via V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> receptors on endotheli</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al cells.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12139]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Used in labor to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    level</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of factor VIII</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12140]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> I/V 0.3u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g/kg, Repeat 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 – 24hrs, Risk of tachyphylaxis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12141]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> HTN</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, pre – eclampsia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antidiuretic effect =&gt; hyponatremi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a – fits.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fluid restriction to 1 lit/day/</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12144]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Electrolyte </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>monito</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Level monitoring before and after treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>r Factor VIII:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If DDVAP not effective, monitor levels before, after and 4 – 6 hours after infusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12148]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12149]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Intrapartum Care Plan</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Written/ documented in advance of 37 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anesthesia evaluation, Neonat</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ologist informed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ECV</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in Male</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> not recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In female ECV can be done</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gender not known</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – avoid ECV</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IPC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MOD discussed in MDT – target levels &gt;1 IU/ml</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>affected Male Fetus/ unknown status.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Elective </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> section </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 39 weeks with a clear Plan in case of spontaneous labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider Maternal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Bleeding risks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12161]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12162]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Female gender or unaffected male</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12163]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Vaginal delivery:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> spontaneous labor is preferred.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IOL if concerns regarding travel to specialist center.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12165]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>2</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><em><strong>nd</strong></em></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> Stage:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Plan documented, involving senior </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obstetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid midcavity forceps, ventouse, FBS scalp Electrodes, Outlet or low Forceps can be used.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12167]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No Measures in case of Female f</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>etus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12168]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ICH more in Pre – Term Babies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12169]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Analgesics/ Anaesthesia:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12170]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regional Anaesthesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (target</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 0.5IU/ml</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neuraxial</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Hematoma – Neurological injury.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12171]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/M injections avoided</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> if levels</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&lt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 0.5IU/ml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12172]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthesia evaluation by senior Anaesthetist @ 32 – 34 weeks after knowledge of VIII/IX levels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12173]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Haemostatic Management during labor/ Delivery:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12174]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Levels &lt; 0.5IU/ml -&gt; treatment:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12175]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DDAVP to    VIII.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12176]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Factor IX concentrate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12177]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Targets 1 IU/ml.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12178]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tran</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ex</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>amic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Acid:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12179]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Solely in low</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> normal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> levels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12180]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In combination </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>with factor </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in low levels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12181]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment as close as labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12182]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post partum care</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12183]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Active 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of labour</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12184]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maintain levels </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>after</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> labour</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12185]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 days after SVD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12186]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5 days after C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12187]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tranexa</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acid till </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lochia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is minimal (21 – 58days carrier).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12188]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis avoided if level &lt; 06, use </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UfH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> If it is required.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12189]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PPH prophylaxis: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12190]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tranexamic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> acid 1g three times a day</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for 7 – 14 days (all Pts).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12191]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonat</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>al Management:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12192]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord blood sampling – results interpreted against age – adjusted ranges.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12193]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Repeat testing 3 – 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of age in mild cases.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral vitamin K.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>affected</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12195]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cranial USG </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>neonates.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI Skull – if S/S of ICH or ICH on USG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short term P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> prophylaxis – severe/ Moderate cases with traumatic delivery, Pre – Term</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> birth</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and @   ed risk of bleeding.</span></p>
