<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Target Levels:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12200]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antenatal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = &gt; 0.5</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12201]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment given &gt; 1.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12202]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/P &gt;1.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Procedures = &gt; 0.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12204]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PP = &gt; 0.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VTE prophylaxis &gt; 0.6.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12206]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/M injections &gt; 0.5/</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regional </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthesia </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 0.5</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12208]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal Effects of Hemophilia:</strong></u></span></p>
