<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Definitive:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Renal Biopsy C/I in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Management:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Same as Gest HTN &amp; Pre-eclampsia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In MDT setting</span></p>
