<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12679]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SLE Flare</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12681]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Half of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12682]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12683]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG for IUGR: Uterine A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rtery</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12684]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>¼ IUGR, 35% in lupus nephritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12685]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Echo: with Anti RO/LA Ab or cardiac abnormalities on USG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12686]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Persiste</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nt Bradycardia 60 – 80</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>congenital heart</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12687]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>bpm between 18 – 28 weeks</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>     </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt''>block 2-3% of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt''>Ant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 7pt''>i</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>                                        </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>RO Anti LA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12688]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrence is 16%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12689]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Lupus: </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12690]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After UV exposure 2 weeks after birth up to 3 – 6weeks </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12691]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rarely Neonatal lupus with heart block.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12692]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12693]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Drugs:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12694]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Give:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12695]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> don’t cross placenta</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12696]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prednisolone</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12697]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrocortisone</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12698]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Methyl prednisolone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12699]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Azathioprine </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12700]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NSAIDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12701]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cyclosporine.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12702]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydroxychl</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oroquine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12703]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Don’t Give:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12704]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Cross placenta</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12705]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dexamethasone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12706]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Betamethasone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12707]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Methotrexate</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12708]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cyclosporine.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12709]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mycophenolate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mofetil.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12710]"> </p>
