<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12713]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>APPENDICITIS IN PREGNANCY</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12714]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/800 suspected </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cases of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>appendicitis in pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12715]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/800-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/1500 confirmed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> cases of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> appendicitis in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12716]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterus enlarges =&gt; upward pushing of abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> wall =&gt; absent classical signs, Rt lower Quadrant pain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> only</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in 75%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12717]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Guarding = 50%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12718]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Investigations</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12719]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CBC leukocytosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12720]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CRP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12721]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12722]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sensitivity 67 – 100%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12723]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specificity, 83 – 96%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12724]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CT – avoid.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12725]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI if USG is inconclusive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12726]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12727]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal loss:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12728]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Simple appendicitis 1.5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>%</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12729]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Generalized</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> peritonitis 6%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12730]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Perforated 36%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12731]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lower index of suspicion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12732]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>35% Negative laparotomies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12733]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/OP normal appendix =&gt; remove.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12734]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Incision:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12735]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transverse over Max tenderness.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12736]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lower midline (if diagnosis is not confirmed).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12737]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Laparo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>scopy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – safe in all </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, can be done </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12738]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ch</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ronic</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> appendicitis:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12739]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Walled of appendicitis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12740]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Medical treatment F/B definitive treatment after pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12741]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prolong symptoms with conservative treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12742]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>An</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>a</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>esthesia:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12743]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regional safe.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12744]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>General with risks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12745]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Desaturation in pregnant women within 3 min as compared to non-pregnant 9 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12746]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tocolysis not required (GA is tocolytic).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12747]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FHR after 24 hours (before &amp; after procedure).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12748]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Opiates, NSAIDS up to 32 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12749]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis till admission.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12750]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntibiotics are given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12751]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>D/D:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12752]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ectopic pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12753]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gastroenteritis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12754]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Miscarriage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12755]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Musculoskeletal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12756]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pyelonephritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12757]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HELLP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12758]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12759]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chorioamni</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oni</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tis – occult-chorio with intact Membranes – lister</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12760]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ovarian vein thrombosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12761]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Effect of Pregnancy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12762]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = all/none.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12763]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = safest for surgery,</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre – term labour 1% (9% in 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12765]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No risk of anomalies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = steroid 24 – 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/section rarely done with </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>concomitant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> appendectomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Performed if Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> indication is there or to enhance view of surgical site.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12769]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12770]"> </p>
