<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12798]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>PKU - PHENYLKETONURIA</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12799]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Autosomal Reces</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sive 1/10,000.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12800]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More in Turkish &amp; Irish ethnicity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12801]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deficiency of PAH </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>phenylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hydroxylase enzyme.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12802]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PKU – most common in born error of Metabolism.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12803]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phenylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is converted to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– tyrosine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with the help of enzyme PAH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12804]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PKU in Maternal blood Causes</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12805]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUGR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12806]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heart defects 7 – 10%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12807]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Development defects</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12808]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rash</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12809]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Microcep</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ha</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12810]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Facial </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dysmo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rph</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ism</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; like FAS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fetal Alcohol syndrome</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12811]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Types:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12812]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Classical</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12813]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Absent PAH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12814]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phenylalanine levels &gt; 1200 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l/L</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12815]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Non – Classical:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12816]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild to moderate PAH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12817]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pathogenesis:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12818]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phenylalanine level – cross placenta.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12819]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12820]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Teratogenesis, behavioral/ developmental problems.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12821]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12822]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tyrosine -&gt;    melanin -&gt; fair skin, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>blue</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> eyes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12823]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment of PKU:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12824]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phenylalanine restricted diet (avoid animal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>proteins</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12825]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12826]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12827]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre – pregnancy: Contraception till optimal Phenylalanine levels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12828]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target phe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (120 – 300 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>µ</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>l/l).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12829]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discontinue contraception if phe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> level &lt; 350.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Allow pregnancy when 3 – 4 levels of P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>henylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt; 350.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ANC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12832]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nylalanine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> level 3 times/ week.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12833]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12834]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dietitian.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12835]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obstetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12836]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Midwife.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12837]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amino acid, trace minerals.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12838]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ Smoking &amp; 20 – 22weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12839]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tyrosine </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>supplementation</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> after 16 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12840]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12841]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dairy egg, chicken, fish, Beans, Oats, Wheats, nuts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12842]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weight gain = microcephaly </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12843]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Link between weight gain and microcephaly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12844]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Delivery:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> indicat</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12845]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Unplanned pregnancies:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Anomaly scan @ FMU.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12846]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal Monitoring</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12847]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anomaly scan.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12848]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Echo</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12849]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doppler – IUGR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12850]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Microcep</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ha</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ly:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12851]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosed @ 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12852]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HC &lt; 2.5 SD = Suspect.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12853]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HC &lt; 5.5 SD = Confirmed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12854]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breast Feeding safe.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12855]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal PKU:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12856]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testing @ D – 5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12857]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Psychological Assessment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12858]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 18</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>months</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12859]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Then @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4, 8</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 14</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> years</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12860]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To access cognition and behavior.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dietary restriction for 5 – 6 years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12862]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12863]"> </p>
