<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>HbA1C Monito</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13283]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>At booking – all women with pre – existing diabetes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13284]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to assess risk/</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13285]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All women with GDM @ diagnosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t measure to check the control.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Targets: &lt;48</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6.5%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Hypoglycemi</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>a &amp; insulin Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13289]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aspart/ Lispro – rapid acting – recommended during pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13290]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain hypoglycemia and treatment:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13291]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fasting acting glucose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13292]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Glucagon – type I.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13293]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer continuous S/C insulin infusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13294]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If hypoglycemia + uncontrolled BSL with Multiple dosage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13295]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Continuous glucose monitoring:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t offer routinely.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13298]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Problematic Hypoglycemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13299]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unstable BSL.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13300]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To gain info</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rmation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> about variability in BSL.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ketone Monitoring/Testing:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13302]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Type I:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer strips &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>meter</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13304]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Home testing if unwell or raised BSL</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent help if ketones positive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13306]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Type II + GDM:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unwell or hyperglycemia | seek urgent help.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13308]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent ketones</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13309]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Positive ketones Admit level II.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13310]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Retinal Assessment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13311]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>preexisting</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> DM (if not done in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>previous </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13312]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ booking.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13313]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13314]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pts with retinopathy @ booking (1 additional)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13315]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 16 – 20weeks again @ 28weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13316]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 6months after child birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13317]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaginal birth is not C/I in retinopathy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13318]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Renal Assessment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13319]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer – (if not done in 3m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13320]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Refer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to nephrologist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13321]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Creatinine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 1.2</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13322]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Albumin: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>creatinine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 30mg/mol.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13323]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Protein excretion &gt; 0.5g/ day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13324]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t use GFR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13325]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13326]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Albumin: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>creatinine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 220mg/mol</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13327]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Proteinuria</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 5g/day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal Monitoring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anomaly Scan for structural anomalies + heart defects including:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13330]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>chambers</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3 vessels.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Out flaw track.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13333]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13334]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Most common</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VSD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13336]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Pathognomonic:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sacral agenesis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Growth + well-being: @</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>28, 32, 36 weeks including AFI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13340]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Routine Doppler, BPP, CTG, not recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13341]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IUGR + Growth Scan:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13342]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Macro vascular disease.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13343]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nephropathy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre-eclampsia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IPC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13346]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discuss with women:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13347]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Timing of birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13348]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mode.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthesia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Type I + II:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No other complications | </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>37 – 38 + 6 weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>With fetal/ maternal or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13353]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> metabolic complication | </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>before 37 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13354]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>GDM:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13355]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No complications | </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Before 40 + 6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13356]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Elective birth if not delivered till 40 + 6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13357]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>With complications | </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FF0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Elective birth before </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>40+6</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13358]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Whenever complications arise.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13359]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mac</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>rosomia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> on USG:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13360]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discuss with women:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13361]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SVD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13362]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IOC.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13363]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13364]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>An</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>a</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>esthesia:</strong></u></span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-08-023-1', 't-mm-08-023', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13365]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evaluation in 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13366]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If DM + comorbidities:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13367]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obesity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13368]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neuropathy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13369]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>G.A:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13370]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BSL every 30 min from induction of anesthesia till delivery of baby &amp; women as conscious.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13371]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Regional </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>naesthesia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13372]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BSL every 1 hour</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13373]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>BSL</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Monitoring During labour</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13374]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 hourly </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(target</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 4 – 7 m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ol/lit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13375]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Insulin infusion</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Type I – all women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13376]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ Dextrose.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##EE0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Type II, GDM:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13377]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If BSL is not between 4 – 7 mmol/lit during labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13378]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13379]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13380]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13381]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery in unit where resuscitation available during 24 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13382]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BSL level – 2 – 4hours after birth (routinely).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13383]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Polycythemia, Hyper bilirubinemia</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13384]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypocalcemia, hypo magnesemia</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>clinical </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>signs</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13385]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Echo if clinical signs present</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13386]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Admissions:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13387]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypoglycemia + abnormal signs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13388]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>RDS </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pre – term &lt; 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13389]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiac signs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13390]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Encephalopathy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13391]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Polycythemia (partial exchange Tx).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13392]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Need for I/V fluid </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or N</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – G feeding.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13393]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Jaundice – requiring phototherapy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13394]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypoglycemia:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13395]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early feeding within 30 min – every 2 – 3 hours until BSL = 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mol/lit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13396]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not effective feeding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13397]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal clinical signs.   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>N – G </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>feeding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13398]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 2 mol on 2 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reading </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##EE0000; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13399]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Despite Max feeding.       </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>I/V dextrose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13400]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t Discharge before 24 hours.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13401]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PNC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13402]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduce insulin dose immediately after birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13403]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Shift to pre pregnancy regimen or cut the dose </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 50% if it is diagnosed 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> time in pregnancy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13404]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13405]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13406]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13407]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13408]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13409]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13410]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13411]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13412]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13413]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13414]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13415]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13416]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>GDM:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13417]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lifestyle modifications</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13418]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6 – 3 weeks post-natal fasting BSL.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13419]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 13 weeks – fasting BSL or HbA1C.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13420]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fasting 6 or HbA1c &lt; 39</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 5.</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>7%.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13421]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low probability of DM @ present.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13422]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue lifestyle modification</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13423]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Annual testing HbA1C.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13424]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Moderate risk of type 2 DM</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13425]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fasting 6 – 6.9 or HbA1C 39 </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>-</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>47</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>=</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 5.7 – 6.5%</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13426]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>High risk of type 2 DM.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13427]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advice regarding prevention.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13428]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fasting &gt;7 or HbA1C &gt; 48 </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>=</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> 6.5%.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13429]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Have DM type (2).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13430]"> </p>
