<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13508]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Identification</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> and treatment of cause:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13509]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>History, Examination CBC.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13510]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Investigations:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13511]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CBC</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13512]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urine analysis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cultures.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>P</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>atient</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Monitoring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BSL – hourly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13516]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ketones – hourly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Then 2 hourly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13518]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>S/E – 2 hourly </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13519]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BUN, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>creatinine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 2 hourly until stable.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13520]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PH – 2 hourly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13521]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal Monitoring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13522]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirm viability.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13523]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13524]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG if indicated.</span></p>
