<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13646]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anaesthetist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13647]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Multiparous low risk in Midwifery led unit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13648]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Active management of 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13649]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13650]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IOL chances of LSCS and macrosomia.</span></p>
