<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13811]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Weight loss</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> limit weight gain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> maximum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pounds in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13812]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring of visual field &amp; visual acuity – risk of optic nerve infarction.</span></p>
