<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13857]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>W</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>orst</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> headache</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13858]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrent, Sudden, Severe headache over 1 – 3weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13859]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13860]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Take expert</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> opinion, ca – channel blocker, high dose </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>steroid, mgso</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13861]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Imaging in Pregnancy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13862]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CT recommended fetal expose &lt; 0.005Mgy (accepted in pregnancy cumulative dose 50Mgy).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13863]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13864]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Gadolinium recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13865]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contrast media containing element iodine not recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13866]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If used Neonatal thyroid function should be checked.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13867]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13868]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13869]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13870]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[13871]"> </p>', 0);

