<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14033]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Microangiopathic haemolytic anemia (   Hb and Retics)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14034]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombocytopenia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14035]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14036]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Renal impairment (AKI)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14037]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neurological manifestations</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14038]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Headache</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14039]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Irritability</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14040]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drowsiness</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14041]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Seizures</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14042]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Coma </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14043]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SLE:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14044]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20 – 49% - renal involvement.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14045]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>16% renal disease activation in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14046]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10% of lupus nephrites develop ARF in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14047]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Obstructive Nephropathy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14048]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pelvicalyceal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> system + ureteral dilatation </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>are</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> normal in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14049]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pathological if:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14050]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dilatation of urethra distal to Brim.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14051]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ureteric jet absents.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14052]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obstruction don’t disappear by positioning the women on all four.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14053]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Drugs:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14054]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Penicillin</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14055]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cephalosporins</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14056]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PPI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14057]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Common drugs and their effects on kidneys:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14058]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Naproxen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – AKI.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14059]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Indomethacin nephrotoxicity – nephritis, hyperkalemia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14060]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>profen – nephritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14061]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Meloxicam – very little renal effects.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14062]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Adverse Effects of NSAIDS:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14063]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14064]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>GI:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14065]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dyspepsia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14066]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ulceration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14067]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bleeding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14068]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Colonic str</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14069]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Renal:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14070]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AKI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14071]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyperkalemia 10 – 46%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14072]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Na retention.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14073]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Interstitial nephritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14074]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Papillary necrosis.</span></p>', 0);

