<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14081]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyperventilation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14082]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Respiratory diseases:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14083]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asthma</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14084]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chest infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14085]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VTE – embolism.</span></p>
