<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14088]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CVS:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14089]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Arrhythmias</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14090]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IHD</span></p>
