1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>No reactive shivering,</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"> sweating.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0AE" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">→</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Inadequate response</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"> to environmental</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"> temp change.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0AE" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">→</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Inflammation =&gt; febrile</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0AE" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">→</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Response is </li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Inadequate</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;