<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14612]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IPC:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14613]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterine contractions travel via </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>franken Hauser’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> plexus @ T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>10</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14614]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ervical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dilatation </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>perceives</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @ T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>11</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>12</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14615]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural – early esp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecially</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in higher lesion to reduce AD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14616]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Indwelling Cather.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14617]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaginal exam + catheterization =&gt; Gently + local Anaestheti</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> gel.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14618]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CEFM.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14619]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid force flexion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14620]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Instrumental delivery if AD is not controlled.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14621]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OVD with st</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>andard</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>analgesia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> consider Rapid Spinal Anaesthesia.</span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-08-034-1', 't-mm-08-034', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14622]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ergometrine can be given in women with no risk of AD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14623]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>C/S:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14624]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>47% if SCI @ T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>5</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14625]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20% if below T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>5</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14626]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>On obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> indication.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14627]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Skin incision 2cm above suprapubic catheter.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14628]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suprapubic catheter.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14629]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Change catheter 24 hours before surgery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14630]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use of non-absorbable sutures on rectus &amp; skin – remove 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Day.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14631]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Physiotherapy to prevent DVT.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14632]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 hourly care to prevent skin ulcers. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14633]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Episiotomy</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14634]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Under standard anaesthesia – although pain not perceived but can trigger AD, so must give Anaesthesia =&gt; Absorbable structure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14635]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14636]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Post op care =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>same as</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in normal Pts.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14637]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14638]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14639]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14640]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Contraception:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14641]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pop, progesterone injection, implants = can be given</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14642]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Male/ Female sterilization = can be offered</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14643]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD, COC = Avoid.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14644]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SCI During Pregnancy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14645]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Miscarriages &amp; anomalies due to hypoxia in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14646]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resuscitation &amp; impatient AN care.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[14647]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thromboprophylaxis for 3m</span>­<span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
