igure 97a68517a915791856fbaac5" viewbox="447675 -28575 238125 285750" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="60d7dcf57997d4434b5968b18bc01989c9ea6d288031a63ca663981cdf46144a"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-bd5add7d99abcd5b3fc1" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="bd5add7d99abcd5b3fc1" transform="translate(576580 16782)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 141514" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-bd5add7d99abcd5b3fc1)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>-    Live Birth rates.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">AA are present in:</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- All – Hashimoto’s.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 2/3rd of pp thyroiditis.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- ¾ of Graves.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- thyroid autoimmunity = 25%.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- predictor of thyroid disease</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="c085e05547d45dc0fa949792" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-043"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure c085e05547d45dc0fa949792" viewbox="381000 -28575 228600 295275" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="747a7510812c472658e6fbc6bc5b74774e71bab854e78ad93b95446bea781076"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-af1cf428e6361c368b5e" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="af1cf428e6361c368b5e" transform="translate(503192 24039)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 141515" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-af1cf428e6361c368b5e)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>   Pregnancy outcomes if Ab in subclinical hypo.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:71.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Treatment </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:121.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- to improve general health </p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- 6m0 contraception after radio – active treatment.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:103.5pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Thyroxine replacement.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">-  Keep TSH &lt; 2.5.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">- Repeat TFTs after 6 weeks.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:108pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Keep TSH &lt; 2.5.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Evidence is lacking.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:71.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="f49f1527a67837b21120b549" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-08-043"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure f49f1527a67837b21120b549" viewbox="904875 85725 942975 952500" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="74409ce45f56e66666e7371951ba6a2558dfa6ee7da4e5a2d0756b10b3df4431"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-c92f20a632a6ea44d7d0" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="c92f20a632a6ea44d7d0" transform="translate(958392 168830)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(387752 398964.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-387752 -398964.5)"><path d="M 0 0 L 775504 797929" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-c92f20a632a6ea44d7d0)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="059c1