<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Always use reference ranges of TSH, FT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>4</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, FT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>3</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> that are</span></p>
