<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manufacturer specific</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15208]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnostic values</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15209]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(don’t use therapeutic range for purpose of diagnosis)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15210]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In the absence of appropriate information set TSH @ 4.0mu/L in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15211]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Therapeutic Reference range</strong></span></p>
