<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15394]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post – Natal Care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15395]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Auto</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>immunity</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in post – natal period is associated with </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15396]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Graves’ relapse</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15397]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>New onset Graves’</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15398]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment in post – natal period</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15399]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antithyroid drugs in 2 or 3 divided doses </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15400]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Both CMZ and PTU can be given </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15401]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring of child’s growth who are breast feeding.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15402]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe ma</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ximum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> doses in lactation </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15403]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CMZ = 20mg, PTU = 450mg daily</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15404]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transfer of CMZ in milk = 0.1 – 0.2% and PTU 0.007% - 0.077%</span></p>', 1);

