<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16127]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>&gt; 6weeks??</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>SVD:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Inform Neonatologist.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Assess Baby sends swabs:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Skin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Oropharynx </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Conjunctiva</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Rectum</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>[SCOR]</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Well</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Not Well</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Acyclovir 20mg/kg</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- I/V Acyclovir            TDS till results are</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- LP is needed</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>         available. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- No LP. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>(lumber puncture)</span></p>
