<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16129]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''><u><strong>Mother refuses:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>1. I/V acyclovir 5mg/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> every </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>8hrs + neonatal acyclovir 20mg/ kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> every</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''> 8 hours</span></p>
