<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>P</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>PROM:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Recurrent:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt;34 oral suppressive dose Acyclovir 400mg TDS till delivery + Erythromycin, steroid + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SVD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16148]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;34 steroid + Erythromycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+IOL</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Herpes</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> before 34 weeks:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT discussion regarding MOD:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expectant management</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> I/V acyclovir </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Erythromycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ steroid </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> c/s ac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cording</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to MDT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> decision</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediate birth – C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 34 weeks, steroid + C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>HIV + herpes:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>suppressive doses from 32 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Urinary retention =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>catheterize</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> the patient </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>15% =&gt; unknown either P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> or recurrent for confirmation PCR is recommended but not in primary.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>FSE, FBS, instrument can be applied in Recurrent.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16160]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16161]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16162]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16163]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16164]"> </p>
