<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Chemo prophylaxis </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not 100% not effective.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Casual prophylaxis </strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7 days after </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>leaving</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16353]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Against liver schizon</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16354]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Malarone (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>atovaquone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>proguanil</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16355]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1 tab daily.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16356]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16357]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Suppressive:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16358]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Continue</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> for </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>4 weeks after </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>leaving</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16359]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Red blood cell stage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16360]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mefloquine 1 tablet/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>week</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16361]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drug of choice in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16362]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Other drugs for chemoprophylaxis:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16363]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Prog</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ua</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ni</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>l</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> + chloro</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>quine</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16364]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not effective in chloro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>quine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> resistan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>t</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> areas</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16365]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Doxy</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>cycline</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> + primaquine:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16366]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CI in pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16367]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Prim</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>aquine:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16368]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cause </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hemolysis in G6PD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16369]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/I in G6PD deficiency.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16370]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Mefloquine:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16371]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe in 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and B.F</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16372]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Chloroquine</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16373]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe in pregnancy but resistance.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16374]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Meflo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>quine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> given in chloro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>quine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> resistan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16375]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Diagnose and Treat promptly:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16376]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Quinine 600mg TDS – 7 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16377]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clind</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>amycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 450mg TDS 5 – 7 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16378]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vomiting within ½ hours – repeat full dose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16379]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vomiting within 30 – 60 min – repeat ½ dose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16380]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment finished then meflo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>quine is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> given after 1 week of last dose.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16381]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Coartem &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>atovaquone</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>progu</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>an</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>il</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can be used if not given in prophylaxis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16382]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16383]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16384]"> </p>
