<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16512]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can stay.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>MOD:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Personalized.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Shorten II</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage if hypoxic/ exhausted.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16516]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>bstetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> involvement.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Water birth:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16518]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asymptomatic can have water birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16519]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cough, fever, feeling unwell avoid</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16520]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transmission – unknown in water.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16521]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PPE less effective when wet.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16522]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Analgesia:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16523]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Entonox with mask can be given</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16524]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural – informed discussion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16525]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Positive elective procedures @ end of list.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16526]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Emergency </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c/s of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>positive COVID </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>woman is done </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> theatre </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>followed by</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> full cleaning.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16527]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16528]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>PNC:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16529]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.F is safe even confirmed COVID.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16530]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rooming in.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16531]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Kangaroo Mother care can be done</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16532]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Deterioration of COVID in pregnancy:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16533]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider bacterial infection if TLC is increasing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16534]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t assume pyrexia as COVID.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16535]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider other possibilities.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16536]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>In</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>patient</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> criteria:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16537]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>One of the following:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16538]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Loss of smell.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16539]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clinical/ Radiological pneumonia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16540]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ARDS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16541]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>&gt;</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 37.8 + cough or nasal discharge/ cough or SOB or sore throat or sneezing wheezing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16542]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>X – ray, CT:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16543]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chest pain, worsening hypoxia, RR &gt; 22.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16544]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider pul</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>monary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> embolism/ Heart Failure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16545]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment of deteriorating COVID:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16546]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Warning signs </strong></em></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Escalate urgently:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16547]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> requirement above 40%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16548]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>RR &gt; 30.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16549]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oliguria</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16550]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AKI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16551]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drowsiness even O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sat are normal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16552]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16553]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fluid balance – given in boluses 250 – 500ml – assess fluid overload.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16554]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>low threshold</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for antibiotics</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16555]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16556]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Physician.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16557]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + midwife.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16558]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anesthetist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16559]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neonatologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16560]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VTE – thrombocytopenia &lt; 50 =&gt; stop aspirin &amp; LMWH + seek neonatologist opinion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16561]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroids:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16562]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prednisolone – 40mg OD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>orally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 10days</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or during </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hospital admission whichever is sooner.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16563]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrocortisone – 8mg B.D I/v.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16564]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider antiviral </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>remdesivir</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16565]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Feto</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>maternal assessment and plan of delivery if required.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16566]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid + Mgso4 for PTB =&gt; should not delay.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16567]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16568]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Young women can compensat</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e for det</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>eriora</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ting </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>resp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>iratory</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> function and have normal O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> saturation. They collapse suddenly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16569]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaccination is safe and recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16570]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute COVID – 19 care pathways</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16571]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16572]"> </p>
