<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16659]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment should be given for CMV.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16660]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Manifestations:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16661]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most – asymptomatic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16662]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15% hearing loss.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16663]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10% symptomatic.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16664]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hepatosplenomegaly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16665]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chorioretinitis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16666]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Petechial </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>purpura</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, jaundice.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16667]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Microcephaly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16668]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SGA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16669]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16670]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16671]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ganciclovir</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> protects against hearing loss and developmental delays.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16672]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oral valacyclovir (20% people got reaction) it reduces risk of transmission to baby.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyper immunoglobulin – investigational.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaccination:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Under trial.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>According to obstetric indications.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16678]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Patient education:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16679]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To all women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.F:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16681]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe except </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>immune </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>compromised.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16682]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16683]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16684]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16685]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16686]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16687]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16688]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16689]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16690]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16691]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16692]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16693]"> </p>
