<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16913]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>1.12.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>PARVOVIRUS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16914]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incubation period 4 – 14 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16915]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DNA – virus single stranded DNA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16916]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Spontaneous replication in diving cells (S – phase).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16917]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Replicate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>inhibit CFU &amp; cause lysis of human erythroid progenitor cells.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16918]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Transmission:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Droplets borne:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50 – 90% house hold contact.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16921]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>20 – 30% in school staff.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16922]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Out Breaks: </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>in spring.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16923]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50% of child bearing are immune.</span></p>
