<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16939]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16940]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vertical transmission 30% (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>so</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> TOP not indicated).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16941]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1% of susceptible individuals are infected /year, 1 infection /400 pregnancy, 23 times higher during epidemics.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16942]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fetal risks:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16943]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Loss rate 9% highest in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16944]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrops 3% commonest finding (10 – 20% of non – immune hydrops).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16945]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reticulocytosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (&gt; 20% Good prognostic sign)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16946]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>spontaneous recovery 34% </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16947]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD &lt;10% after 4 – 6weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16948]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16949]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IgM (3 days – 6m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16950]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pregnancy + rash + arthralgia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16951]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exposure</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> history</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16952]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non – immune hydrops.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16953]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16954]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16955]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>History, examination.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16956]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Counselling + decision to investigate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16957]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>A/N Booking serum</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16958]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not available</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Take sample for igG + IgM when rash appears or 21 days after exposure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16959]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Available </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16960]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16961]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sero positive</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sero</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> negative</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16962]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16963]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IgM positive</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Infected</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Refer to specialist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>USG for fetal anemia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IUT if needed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IgG negative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>IgM negative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Susceptle but not infected</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>F/u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IgG positive</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IgM negative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reassure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16964]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16965]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No risk</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16966]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16967]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16968]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16969]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16970]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16971]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Serial USG for up to 12 weeks after confirmed infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16972]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16973]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maternal – symptomatic treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16974]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrops – FMU referral.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16975]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery if Gestation is appropriate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16976]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FBS with conservative management if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reticulocytosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> positive.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16977]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUT if anemia on FBS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16978]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Transmission:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16979]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 15 weeks = 15%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16980]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15 – 20 weeks = 25%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16981]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Last </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = 70%.</span></p>
<div class="mm-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:131.35pt;"><col style="width:120.15pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.55pt;background-color:#BDD6EE;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Syphilis</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.6pt;background-color:#BDD6EE;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Parvovirus</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Still birth + Hydrops</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Placentomegaly</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Petechia all over skin</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>VDRAL/RPR = acute syphilis</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>@ 14 weeks = 40 – 50% infection</li></ul></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.6pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Still birth + Hydrops</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">No palcentomegaly</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">No petechial</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">School out break</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">80% poly arthritis in mother.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16982]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Important facts about perinatal infections:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maculopapular rash on palms and soles</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> periostitis =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>syphilis</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrocephaly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ntracerebral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> calcification, chorioretinitis=&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Toxo</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>plasmosis</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> treatment sulfadiazine + </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>leucovorin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cataract, SN deafness VSD, PDA, extramedullary hematopoiesis =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>rubella</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> B/L hearing loss.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Microcephaly, PV calcification, deafness    Plt, petechia =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CMV</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> unilateral deafness treatment ganciclovir.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Limb hypoplasia, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cutaneous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> lesions =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>v</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>aricella</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Still born + petechial rash = </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>listeria</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EONNS + maternal cheese intake = </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>listeria</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Most common cause of EONNS = </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>GBS</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> most common cause of EONNS= </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>listeria</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CMV</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> trans</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mission</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>= 40%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CMV</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recent infection = low avidity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CMV</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> infection = high avidity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16996]"> </p>
