<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>1.13.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>HEMOPHILUS INFLUENZAE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[16999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>G – negative Aerobic bacilli.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17000]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commensal of vaginal flora can cause:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17001]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chorioamni</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oni</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometritis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17003]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neonatal infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosis = culture / ELIZA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17005]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hemophiles</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Ducreyi = STD, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>chancroid</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17006]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Cause:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17007]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PTB.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17008]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LBW.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17009]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment in Pregnancy:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17010]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Azithromycin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17011]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Erythromycin.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Ch</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>anc</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>roid.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17012]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ceftriaxone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17013]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>H – Influenza: cephalosporin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17014]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Annual vaccination recommended by WHO.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17015]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaccine safe in pregnancy &amp; B.F.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H1N1:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>RNA virus.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Infect birds and mammals.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17019]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Transmission by aerosol + direct contact.</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17020]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neuraminidase is involved in release of new viruses from infected cells.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17021]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17022]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>   </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Treatment:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17023]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oseltamivir</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Inhibit </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>neuraminidase</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + halt viral </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17024]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Zanamivir</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>replication.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- More effective if started within few </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hours</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of onset of symptoms.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Licensed for use within 48 hours of </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms onset </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>and can be</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>given</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> within 7 days.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Duration of symptoms by 11.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>days.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-   Risk of complications</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17025]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17026]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>PEP:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17027]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Oseltamivir within 48 hours of exposure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17028]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Zanamivir within 36 hours of exposure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17029]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Prevention:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17030]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vaccination </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pander mix</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – yearly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17031]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoidance of exposure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17032]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antiviral prophylaxis in case of exposure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17033]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe disease =&gt; referral to hospital.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17034]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Influenza:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17035]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>myalgia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, SOB, cough.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17036]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>O/E</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>   </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reduced</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> air entry, coa</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>se crackles @ base.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17037]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CXR</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> one lobe is collapsed / consolidation throughout both lungs.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17038]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Atypical pneumonia</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>:</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17039]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fever, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>myalgia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, SOB, cough.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17040]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Examination same as influenza</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17041]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>C</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>XR:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> lower </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lobe</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> collapse/ consolidation throughout both </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>lungs’</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sputum negative for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gram stain</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing and culture negative.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17042]"> </p>
