<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Careful history Nausea/ Vomiting =&gt; intolerance not allergy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Mild rash with penicillin =&gt; 1 – 3% are allergic to cephalosporin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/ Cross reaction.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17198]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Anaphylaxis with penicillin =&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong> Avoid</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Cephalosporin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17200]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- carbapenem.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17201]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong>Discuss</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>: infection specialist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17202]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><em><strong>Alterative:</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Erythro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>my</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>cin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>, clindamycin, vancomycin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Potential sites outside the Genital Track &amp; their Presentation:</strong></u></span></p>', 1);
