<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17326]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17327]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Role of immunoglobulins:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V immunoglobulins should be considering as part of treatment for G positive and Toxic Shock Syndrome when other measure are failing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not effective for G negative or sepsis in general.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17330]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Limited use in sickest women</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use in critical care s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>et</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ting.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use where blood warning device available.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17333]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Clinda</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>mycin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> + IVIG are reported synergistic and beneficial</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17334]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>C/I:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Congenital immunoglobulins A deficiency.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17336]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Dose:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2g/kg.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal monitoring:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite birth in critically ill women if it is beneficial.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17340]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decision by senior obstetrician after discussion with women and/ or family.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17341]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Preterm birth:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17342]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mgso4 and steroids should be considered.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17343]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CEFM.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of neonatal encephalopathy and CP is    ed in case of I/U infection. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Care:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17346]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Babies of women treated for sepsis during labor or within 24 hours before or after birth should be assessed for neonatal infection.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17347]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If either women or baby is infected with GAS disease in post – partum period, both should be treated with Antibiotics.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17348]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Infection control strategies:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All women after birth should be informed about signs and symptoms of genital tract infection, (written + verbal) + guidance regarding hygiene, hand washing &amp; seeking help when feel unwell.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All women identified with GAS infection during pregnancy should be aggressively treated.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All close contact with GAS infected women should seek medical advice &amp; if symptoms develops should be treated with A/B.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All healthcare professionals who are exposed to respiratory secretions of GAS infected women should be considered for A/B.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17353]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women with GAS infected should be cared by barrier nursing including clothing, masks, limited mobility.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17354]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17355]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17356]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17357]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17358]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17359]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17360]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17361]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17362]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17363]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17364]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17365]"> </p>
