<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17517]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Clinical examination</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>SFH </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>+</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> FHR</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Positive</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>negative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>immediate USG to exclude IUD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to exclude immediate compromise.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manage ac</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cording</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to unit</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>protocol</span></p>
