<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17531]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>SMALL FOR GESTATIONAL AGE:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17532]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Defini</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>tions:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17533]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Appropriate for Gest</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ational</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Age:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17534]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal size between 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and 90</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17535]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Small for Gest Age (SGA):</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17536]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal size &lt; 10 centile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17537]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal Growth restriction FGR:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17538]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal size &lt; 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17539]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal size &lt;10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile + Doppler Abnormalities.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17540]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(abnormal uterine or Umbilical artery Doppler).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17541]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17542]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Early onset FGR:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17543]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 31 + 6 weeks.</span></p>
