<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17549]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal size &lt; 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17550]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17551]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UA – absent end diastolic flow.</span></p>
