<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17737]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early FGR up to 32 weeks:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* EFW</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* U/A </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Doppler weekly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>24 – 35 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>26 – 28 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>29 – 31 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>32 – 33 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>34 – 36 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Individualized care.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 2.6ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 3ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – wave absent on DV.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 3.5ms on CCTG.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AEDF or REDF in umbilical artery</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Monitor @ least twice weekly with CCTG and/or DV Doppler</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>Management of FGR</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>:</span></p>
