<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17744]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FGR 32 – 36 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* EFW - fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* U/A Doppler – weekly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>STV &lt; 4.5ms.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AEDE.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery by 36 – 36 + 6weeks if PI &gt; 95</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th </sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>centile on UAD</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Umbilical artery Doppler PI &gt; 95</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitor @ least twice weekly CCTG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17745]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17746]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17747]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17748]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17749]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17750]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AC/EFW &lt; 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> centile by 37 + weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>When FGR can’t be excluded.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Any signs of centile redistribution.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STV &lt; 4.5.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AREDF.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver if:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>SGA by 39 + 0 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>STV &lt; 4.5.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>AREDF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Deliver all SGA till 39 + 6 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>37 – 38 + 6weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 39 weeks.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>SGA Term 37 weeks onwards:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>* EFW - fortnightly.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>* UAD weekly.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17751]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17752]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17753]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17754]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17755]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17756]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17757]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17758]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17759]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17760]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17761]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17762]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17763]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>AEDF on UAD in Early FGR:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17765]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Try to prolong till 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver by 34 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider delivery by 32 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>REDF on UAD in early FGR:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17769]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Try to prolong till 32 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17770]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Deliver by 32 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17771]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider by 30 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17772]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Referral to FM</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>U</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17773]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EFW &lt; 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17774]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>EFW &lt; 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> centile + abnormal uterine artery Doppler.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17775]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Invasive testing:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17776]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe SGA + structural anomalies (offered).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17777]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SGA + structurally normal features before 23 weeks + normal uterine artery Doppler (considered).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17778]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>An</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>alysis includes:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17779]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Micro array to detect micro insertions &amp; micro deletions.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17780]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pre – natal exome sequencing should only be considered in cases with multi system abnormalities or isolated short long bones.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17781]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17782]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Serological Screening of Infections:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17783]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incidence of FGR due to infections is 5%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17784]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Causative Agents:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17785]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CMV, toxoplasmosis, malaria, syphilis </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17786]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full TORCH screening is not recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17787]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testing should be based on presentation and history.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17788]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>CMV:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Testing should be offered in severe SGA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17789]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Malaria:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> offered to those who have travelled in endemic areas. It is a significant cause of PTB and LBW.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17790]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Zika Virus</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: FGR is seen in 10% of infected women and is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>femur</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sparing pattern of FGR testing is offered to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>high-risk</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> population.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17791]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment or interventions for FGR:</strong></u></span></p>', 1);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-09-018-2', 't-mm-09-018', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17792]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No proven intervention except birth of baby.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17793]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>LMWH no role.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17794]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Phosphodiesterase 5 inhibitors – no proven role.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17795]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17796]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17797]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Birth of FGR/ SGA:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17798]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Pre – Term FGR:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17799]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Involvement of MDT:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17800]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obstetrician.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17801]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neonatologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17802]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal medicine if birth before 28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17803]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In – utero Transfer – if non availability of cot.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17804]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid cover – offer 24 – 34 + 6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17805]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduces neonatal death, RDS and perinatal death.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17806]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Effective between 48 hours to 7 days of administration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17807]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>M</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SO4 – offer @ 24 – 29 + 6 weeks, consider @ 30 – 33 + 6 weeks reduces neurological developmental abnormalities.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17808]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mode of Birth:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17809]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>C – section is recommended in:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17810]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal CCTG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17811]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DV Doppler alteration.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17812]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Absent diast</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>olic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17813]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reverse diabolic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17814]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>IOL is offered if:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17815]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SGA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17816]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Late FGR with (N) umbilical artery Doppler.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17817]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Late FGR abnormal umbilical artery PI.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17818]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>There is risk of emergency C/section in IOL &amp; need for continuous fetal monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17819]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider mechanical methods of induction.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17820]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Spontaneous Labor:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17821]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early admission in labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17822]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continuous fetal heart rate monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17823]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SGA/ FGR fetuses’ area @    ed risk of hypoxia suspected fetal compromise and late deceleration on CTG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17824]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Postnatal investigations:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17825]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Placental histopathology.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17826]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Useful in FGR to plan future pregnancies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17827]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Postnatal Counselling.</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17828]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Proper appointment after birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17829]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aim of appointment is to discuss histopathology report and underlying causes as appropriate like APLS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17830]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Planning for future Pregnancy</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17831]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Planning + preventive strategies like smoking cessation, Aspirin treatment, weight management (if needed).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17832]"> </p>
