<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18396]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Systemic Metho</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>trexate</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18397]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urinary tract injuries 16% vs 57%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18398]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not recommended due to complications</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18399]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Stepwise </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Devas</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>c</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ul</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ariz</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>atio</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>n</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> in percr</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>eta:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18400]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Internal iliac ligation =&gt; preserve uterus 90%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18401]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Undiagnosed PAS during CS:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18402]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18403]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18404]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Close abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>omen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and refer:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18405]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If diagnosed after delivery of baby, then leave placenta in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>situ and do </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hysterectomy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
