<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18448]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ 28 weeks</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- @ 20-24 weeks.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- @28 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18449]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antenatal iron </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>+</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> folic acid reduces anemia by 50%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18450]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> line oral iron</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18451]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Parenteral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Iron:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18452]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Not tolerated/ absorbed.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18453]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Approaching Term.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18454]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PT compliance is poor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18455]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rHuEPo – clinical trials – not recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18456]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Active management of 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage of labor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18457]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delivery of women @ risk of loss &gt; 1000ml =&gt; where blood bank available, and ICU available.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18458]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Principles of TX:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18459]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Valid consent + documentation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18460]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Grouping, screening &amp; cross matching @ booking + 28week:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18461]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 3 days old sample</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> used for cross matching</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18462]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ts</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @ risk of TX =&gt; weekly samples to rule out production of new Antibodies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18463]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ABO</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, RH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-v</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Kell</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve </sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(in pregnancy &amp; PP).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18464]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>P</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ts</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> with antibodies </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>refer to</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> FMU.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18465]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specific Antibodies in Maternal blood =&gt; cross match blood with negative antigen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18466]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CMV</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18467]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Autologous blood Tx not recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18468]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>O</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>bstetric</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> H</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>aemorrhage</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>: </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18469]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>blood &amp; blood products.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18470]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Blood:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18471]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, Kell</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18472]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Later on – Group specific.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18473]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early intervention</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> to minimize loss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18474]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>FFP:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18475]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>12 – 15ml/ kg after 6units of blood.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18476]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PT/ APTT Should &lt;1.5 of normal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18477]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Cryo</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>precipitates</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18478]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>25units pools </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18479]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>target</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> fibrinogen should</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> be</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt;1.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18480]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>FFP</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> &amp; Cryo:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18481]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Same group, no Anti D required.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18482]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18483]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If not available then different ABO with Anti A, Anti B activity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18484]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Plt:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18485]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Target should be </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 75 x 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>9</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18486]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>Group compatible – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>If not available HLA matched plt.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18487]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti D required 250 IU for 5units of Plt within 6 weeks </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18488]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Always use new BT sets.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18489]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>IOCS – is recommended:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18490]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If loss &gt; 20% of volume, or women who refuse blood products (</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Jehovah’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> witness).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18491]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent – written, documented.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18492]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT should perform + IOCS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18493]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>RH</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> women non sensitized.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18494]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IOCS – cord blood positive – 1500IU Anti D.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18495]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keilhauer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Test 30 – 40 min after Transfusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18496]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Use of leukocytes depletion filter – remove amniotic fluid cells but not Fetal cells – so Anti D need to be given</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18497]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Factor vIIa:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18498]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider – but don’t delay surgery/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>embolization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18499]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Off – license.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18500]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Given after discussion with hematologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18501]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fibrinogen </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>concentrate – recommended:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18502]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Levels in pregnancy 3.5 – 5.5</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18503]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Off license.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18504]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Only in clinical trial.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18505]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Anti-Fibrinolytic:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18506]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>I/ Partum anemia.</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18507]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &lt; 7 = clinical d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ecision</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18508]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>P/P</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> anemia = clinical</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> decision</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18509]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Jehovah’s </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>witness:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18510]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consent/ refusal documented.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18511]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Optimization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of Hb.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18512]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Early intervention</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> uses of pharmacological, surgical treatment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18513]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IOCS has role.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18514]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood sparing + techniques (clotting factor) are acceptable.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18515]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>“no blood” wristband.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18516]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18517]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18518]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18519]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18520]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18521]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18522]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18523]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18524]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18525]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18526]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18527]"> </p>
