<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18631]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TTTS, IUGR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18632]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Offer targeted steroid:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18633]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Twins</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 60% deliver before 37 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18634]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Triplets</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 75% deliver before 35 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18635]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Maternal complications</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> of Multiple pregnancy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18636]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>HTN:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Aspirin 75mg after 12 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18637]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If 1 or more of following:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18638]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pregnancy.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18639]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Age &gt;40.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18640]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BMI &gt;35.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18641]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Interval &gt;10 years.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18642]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>History of Pre-eclampsia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18643]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> times risk of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> HTN in primigravida.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18644]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> times risk</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in multigravida.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18645]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydramnios</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 12%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18646]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PTL &gt;50%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18647]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NVP  3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> times</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18648]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Miscarriage </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>risk is twice</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18649]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> complications of multiple pregnancy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18650]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Still </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>birth 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>times</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18651]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Twin entrapment 1/817.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18652]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>SIUD = 2 – 6%.</span></p>
