<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18673]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> loss + neuro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ev</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>elopmental</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> morbidity.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18674]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>          </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> DS </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Screening</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> </u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18675]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> combined </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18676]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup> trimester</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> quadruple.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18677]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Anomaly</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> scan</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18678]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>@</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 18 – 20+6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18679]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commonly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>, Midline</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> structural anomalies in monozygotic twins</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18680]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Holoprosencephaly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18681]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heart</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> defects</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18682]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NTD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18683]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>USG</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 2 weekly from 16 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18684]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@ each USG – Biometry – EFW.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18685]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal bladder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18686]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DVP.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>2 weekly</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18687]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UA, Doppler UAPI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18688]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Complicated MC twining:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18689]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All cases managed with FMU</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18690]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1. </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TTTS:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18691]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of TTTS is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15% </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18692]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>screening by </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NT is </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>not recommended</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18693]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>most commonly due to abnormal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AV – Anastomosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18694]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Symptoms:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sudden    in abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Girth, Breathlessness.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18695]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Screening</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>16</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks onwards.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18696]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Diagnosis:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> History + USG findings </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18697]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Severity = </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Quintero</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Classification:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18698]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage I:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> discordant Amniotic Fluid:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18699]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&lt; 2cm in donor</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18700]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 8cm in recipient</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18701]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 10 after 20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18702]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage II:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Bladder of donor twin not seen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18703]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage III:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler is abnormal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18704]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Arterial </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>changes</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in donor.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18705]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Venous changes in recipient</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18706]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage IV:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Hydrops</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recipient</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> twin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18707]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage V:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> IUD </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of 1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or both twins.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18708]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment </strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18709]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Before 26 weeks:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18710]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> laser ablation by Solomon technique</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18711]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>F</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>ollow up</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weekly for 2 weeks [ USG (Brain, heart, limb) Doppler, UPAI, MCA PSV]</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18712]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Then 2 weekly</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler + Growth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18713]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>S/E:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> functional heart problems.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18714]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>After 26 weeks</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – septostomy/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amnioreduction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18715]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Delivery</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 34 – 36+6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18716]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18717]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SGR:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18718]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10 – 15% alone.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18719]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50% with TTTS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18720]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>FMU</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> referral</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> large A – A anastomosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18721]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>EFW</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em> measurement</em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> from 20 weeks USG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18722]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Discordance:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18723]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Larger Twin – smaller Twin</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> x 100 = Growth </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Larger twin</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>     discordance. </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18724]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>         </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; 20%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18725]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Stages of SGR:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18726]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage I:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rowth discordance</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> but positive diastolic flow in both UA.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18727]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage II:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G.D with absent/ Reverse diastolic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18728]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Stage III:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> G.D with cyclical UA diastolic flow.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18729]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Positive =&gt; absent =&gt; reverse.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18730]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18731]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Surveillance: </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18732]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 weekly Doppler.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18733]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Delivery:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18734]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If growth velocity is (N) &amp; UAD (N)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Early onset</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – poor pr</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ognosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> =&gt; 26 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18735]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective reduction by vascular occlusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18736]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Type I</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>@</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 34 – 36weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18737]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18738]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Type II, </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>III</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>32weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18739]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Longer latency than DC twins.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18740]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Doppler</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> showing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> reverse flow</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18741]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal CTG =&gt; Consider delivery.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18742]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of unpredictable </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transfusional</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> events.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18743]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18744]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TAPS:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18745]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Incidence:</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2% alone and 13% in treated </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18746]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commonly due to Minuscule A –V anastomosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18747]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Postnatal diagnosis </u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18748]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>      </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>TTTS Reticulocytosis</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> difference </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>1.7 or</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u> </u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18749]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb difference &gt; 8 g/dl</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>        </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18750]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Screening after treatment</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of TTTS and SGR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18751]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>17% risk of TAPS after laser of TTTS, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Solomon technique</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>    risk of TAPS (3%).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18752]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>serial monitoring by </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA – PSV </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18753]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>* </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment outcome poorly established.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18754]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18755]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TRAP</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18756]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1% </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18757]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Due to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>large A –A </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>anast</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>omosis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18758]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Discordant Abnormalities:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18759]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent referral to FMU, for Karyotyping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18760]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Meticulous</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> mapping before invasive testing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18761]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sample both sac unless </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Chorionicity</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> determined before 14 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18762]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective Feticide by cord ablation method</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18763]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>DIC monitoring not recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18765]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Single </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>intrauterine</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> death:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> sIUD</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anemia</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in surviving twin</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>dIUD – 15%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18769]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neurological </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>problems in surviving twin </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>25%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18770]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>urgent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> referral</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> to FMU.</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18771]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MRI after 4 weeks of demise of co – twin =&gt; to rule out neurological problems.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18772]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MCA PSV – Doppler after d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>emise </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of co – Twin =&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>to rule out</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Anemia of co – Twin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18773]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Uncomplicated MC Twins</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: delivery 36 – 38 weeks = elective birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18774]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Monoch</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>or</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>on</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>ic monoa</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>m</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>niot</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>i</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>c:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 32 – 34 weeks = elective CS.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18775]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord entanglement.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18776]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Higher order Multiple:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18777]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Selective </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>feticide</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> including triplets.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18778]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Conjoined Twins:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18779]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FMU, MDT management</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18780]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1/90,000 to 1/100,000 pregnancies.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18781]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Survival 25% I/U demise 10%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18782]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18783]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18784]"> </p>', 0);

