<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18918]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CBC, LFT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, U/E, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>coagulation screen.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18919]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Minor – CBC &amp; Blood group</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18920]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Kle</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ih</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>au</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> test</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is not used for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> diagnosis of abruption but in negative mothers for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>estimation of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FMH</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18921]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>USG:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18922]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Placental </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>localization</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18923]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18924]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sensitivity – 24%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18925]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Specificity – 96%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18926]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PPV – 88%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18927]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PPV – 58%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18928]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Fetal:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18929]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG – abnormal in 69% with abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18930]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>USG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18931]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Admission.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18932]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Spotting – Reassure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18933]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heavier than spotting – Admit, work – up,</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18934]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discharge once bleeding settle</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18935]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Steroid: </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18936]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>24 – 34+6weeks if Risk of pre-Term.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18937]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tocolysis:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18938]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Not recommended:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18939]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18940]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Major APH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18941]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hemodynamic instability.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18942]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal compromise.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18943]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Senior </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obstetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should involve in decision making regarding tocolysis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18944]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>C/I:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18945]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is an</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> absolute</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> contraindication</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18946]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mild APH + Previa </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is a r</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>elative</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> contraindication</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18947]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ANC:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18948]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Switch to “High Risk” – obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> led Care</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18949]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> serial growth Scan till its prove normal.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18950]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Birth:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18951]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expectant – CTG (N), Hemodynamically stable, Pre – Term.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18952]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite – abnormal CTG</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>emergency</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> C/S.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18953]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD – deliver</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> immediately,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> C/S may be required.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18954]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unexplained APH with no </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetomaternal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> compromise =&gt; senior obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> should decide regarding MOD &amp; TOD.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18955]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Fetal monitoring</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> : </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>by</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>CEFM</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18956]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>      </strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> </strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Anesthesia:</strong></em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18957]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regional – recommended until no C/I.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18958]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>General =&gt; if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetomaternal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> condition is compromised.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18959]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stable mother but fetal compromise regional is preferred.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18960]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Unstable mother</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> GA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is preferred to facilitate Resuscitation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18961]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Active 3</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><u><strong>rd</strong></u></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> stage of labor</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18962]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ergometrine if no HTN.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18963]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anti D + FMH by Kleihau</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r is recommended.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18964]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>Recurrent APH</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> repeat Anti D after 6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18965]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>P</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong>ts</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> on warfarin/ heparin</strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> –</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> No more doses.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18966]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Further doses after consultation with medical staff &amp; detailed assessment @ hospital.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18967]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Neonatal Management</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – Risk of fetal anemia – May need Transfusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18968]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Major/ Massive =&gt; senior </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pediatrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/ neonatologists.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18969]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Minor =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pediatric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> support only.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18970]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption/ Vasa previa =&gt; senior </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pediatrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> / Neonatologist =&gt; may need tx.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18971]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anterior placenta =&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>experienced</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pediatrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> / Neonatologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18972]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>APH @ 24 – 26 weeks:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18973]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mother is priority.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18974]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Senior </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pediatrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> / Neonatologist should involve in counselling.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18975]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Conservative treatment if mother</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is stable</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18976]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Post – Natal F/U:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18977]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 – 6 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18978]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Principles of Management of APH:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18979]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1. </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Call for help:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>(MDT)</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18980]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Experienced midwife.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18981]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> middle grade, alert consultant.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18982]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anesthesia middle grade, alert consultant.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood tx lab.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Porters of specimen/ blood.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Designate 1 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>person</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> document</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2. </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Initiate Management:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A, B, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C, D, E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> approach</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>D </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> decide delivery after fetal assessment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>3. 4 Pillars of Management:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Communication.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Resuscitation.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18992]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evaluation + Monitoring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18993]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Arrest bleeding and delivery of fetus.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18994]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fluid Replacement and Blood &amp; blood products:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18995]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>A – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Airway + O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 10 – 15 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>liter</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/m</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n.</span></p>', 0);
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-09-025-1', 't-mm-09-025', 'document_html', '<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18996]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breathing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18997]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Circulation 2 – 14G cannulas.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18998]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Left lateral.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[18999]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep warm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19000]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19001]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fluids:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19002]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Crystalloids </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> up to 2 lit</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19003]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Colloid </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1 – 2 lit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19004]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Blood – cross matched if not available – O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19005]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FFP</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19006]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 4 units of FFP (12 – 15ml/kg or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> total</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1 </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>liter)</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19007]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- For 6 units of red cells.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19008]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- If PT/ APTT &gt; 1.5 of mean control.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19009]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PLT concentrate </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=if</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt; 50 x 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>9</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19010]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cryo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>precipitate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>if fibrinogen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &lt; 1g/lit.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19011]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Availability of Blood:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19012]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>O negative = immediately.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19013]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cross matched = 15 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19014]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Properly screened = 1hr.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19015]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Therapeutic Goals:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hb &gt; 8g/dl.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PLT &gt; 75 x 10</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>9</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PT &lt; 1.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19019]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>APTT &lt; 1.5.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19020]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fib</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>rinogen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &gt; 1.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19021]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Colloids:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19022]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Haemaccel.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19023]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Dextran.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19024]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Albumin.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19025]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mannitol</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19026]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6% HES.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19027]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19028]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19029]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19030]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19031]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19032]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19033]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19034]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19035]"> </p>', 1);

