<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19093]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>14.  </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>ANC OF UNCOMPLICATED PREGNANCIES:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19094]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Primi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gravida</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 10 appointments/ visits.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19095]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Multi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gravida</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 7 appointments/visits.</span></p>
