margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Food hygiene.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Life style – (smoking cessation, recreational drug use, alcohol abuse.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">AN screening, risk/benefits.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Discuss issues.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Ask questions.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Booking by 10 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Information giving regarding</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">How baby develops</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Nutrition, diet including vitamin D 10mg/ day.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Exercise, including Pelvic floor.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Antenatal screening.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Pregnancy care pathway.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Place of birth, Breast feeding.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">AN classes.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Maternity benefits.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Screening Tests:</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">1. Blood group + Antibodies.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">2. Screening for Hemoglobinopathies.</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Offer to all.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Types of screening depends upon prevalence:</li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0F0" data-source-marker-font="Wingdings"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">⇨</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>High &gt; 1.5/10,000 high performance chromatography.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0F0" data-source-marker-font="Wingdings"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">⇨</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Less &lt; 1.5/ 10,000.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:108pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="158a4c0a516b0434bce9c51a" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-027"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 158a4c0a516b0434bce9c51a" viewbox="2486025 152400 38100 171450" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="4158b9463f06d66a9909f2266f9d99f3e020d2e58dbeab95018ed2f6a11e9ee5"><g data-mm-object-id="f06741c726d8c3d1aeae" transform="translate(2497622 159953)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1 116305" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Family origin Questionnaire.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="41e090fd10270859ab56ae49" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-027"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 41e090fd10270859ab56ae49" viewbox="838200 47625 3124200 314325" preserveaspec