mpatibility/2006}Choice[1]/w:drawing[1]"></span></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">           High risk                                                                          low risk</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="15fc85cb78f40f09bd8ea2d9" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-027"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 15fc85cb78f40f09bd8ea2d9" viewbox="828675 -38100 247650 381000" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="b067da8f540963fab921326469496e9befbb4880b109621032040dc5018f877d"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#4472C4"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b" transform="translate(953347 9313)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4233 220134" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#4472C4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-84991cc2ec7fcfd4302b)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">           High performance</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">           chromatography</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:72pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">MCV &lt; 27 =&gt; High performance liquid chromatography</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Female carrier =&gt; check partner status.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Heel prick =&gt; neonate.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">3. Anemia, Hep B, HIV, syphilis.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">4. Asymptomatic bacteriuria.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">5. Chlamydia – no test but information given if age is &lt; 25 years.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">6. Dating scan, 10 – 13+6 weeks (CRL up to 84mm, then HC).</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">7. Height, weight, BMI, B.P, proteinuria, risk factor for PTE, GDM.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">8. Screening for down to all women.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Combined: 11 – 13+6 weeks.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Tripple/ Quadruple: after 15 weeks.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">9. Identify genital mutation.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">10. Ask about past/ present mental health illness, depression.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">11. Occupation – identify occupational hazards.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">12. Support @ home – rule out domestic abuse, deprivation.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">@ 16 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Discuss and preview results of screening.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Reassess plan and pattern of care.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Investigate, Hb &lt; 11 and give iron.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>B.P, proteinuria.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Give information, discussion.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">18 – 20 weeks.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Anomaly Scan &amp; its purpose (NT &gt;6mm, 2 or more soft markers).</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="698a8c437682439f066f8e00" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-027"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 698a8c437682439f066f8e00" viewbox="3771900 0 200025 304800" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="2cc9b74755616b6fcaf79b522f2c014fff5b485d06ffaf0529b9093ad9c6d0d6"><g data-mm-object-id="696b7e6c968dbfc59922" transform="translate(3806288 11235)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 187569 L 29307.5 187569 L 29307.5 0 L 87922.5 0 L 87922.5 187569 L 117230 187569 L 58615 246184 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1" stroke="#5B9BD5" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Reproductive choices.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="9b61b483cb30f5ea08898640" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-027"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 9b61b483cb30f5ea08898640" viewbox="3629025 28575 1066800 542925" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="5e38d270ea874f33b3d7079ebccdce4b6f15ed8e2799f3a96a5952b7caafbf7e"><g data-mm-object-id="ddd1457abba4e0655386" transform="translate(3636303 34485)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 1055077 0 L 1055077 527539 L 0 527539 Z" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="none" stroke-opacity="0" stroke-width="6350"></path><g data-mm-text-anchor="t" transform="translate(0 45720)"><text data-mm-wrapped-line="0" x="91440" y="152400" text-anchor="start" xml:space="preserve"></text></g></g></g></svg></figure>Prepare pts for (treatment, disability, TOP).</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"> 4 camber view of heart &amp; outflow track routinely.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">25 weeks.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Only Nulliparous</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">SFH.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.P, proteinuria</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Discussion, information.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">28 weeks </p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">2nd screen for:</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 72pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Anemia.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Atypical Ab.</li><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+002D" data-source-marker-font="Calibri"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">-</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Anti D prophylaxis.</li></ul><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">SFH plotting.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.P proteinuria.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Information, discussion.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">31 weeks.</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Nulliparous B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">SFH, plot.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Information + discussion.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Review screening tests done @ 28 weeks.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Replan care pathway if any problem detected</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">34 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Information, discussion.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Prepare for birth including pain &amp; birth plan, coping with pain.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Recognition of active labor.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">2nd dose Anti D.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">SFH plot.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Review screening tests @ 28 weeks</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">36 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Information, discussion.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.F information.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Care of new born. </p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Vitamin K prophylaxis + Neonatal screening.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Post – natal care.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Baby blue awareness &amp; post – natal depression.</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Check:</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">B.P, protein uria, SFH.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;">Baby position – Breach =&gt; offer ECV.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">38 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.P, proteinuria.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">SFH.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">Information, Discussion.</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">40 weeks</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:362.55pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Nulliparous</p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-indent:-18pt;">B.P, SFH, information, Discussion</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:176.95pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">41