<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>He</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>p</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> B.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19148]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Vaccination C/I in pregnancy:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BCG.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Measles</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mumps.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rubella – avoid conception for 28 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>varicella – avoid pregnancy for 28 days.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HPV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Vaccines specifically indicated:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. DPT – 28 – 32weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. Influenza</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and COVID-19</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> @ any stage to all women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Esp October – January.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t give live influenza.</span></p>
