"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">more</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:69.2pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">less</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:84.2pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Fetal radiation exposure</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:98.1pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="d71d5e015d6fbb8f40583845" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-030"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure d71d5e015d6fbb8f40583845" viewbox="847725 142875 247650 342900" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="8744b54996a6eb61f95f6119997ef4d5934613dcc88d58b791e5cd8c5170f2ec"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-de0885c191c85c35cc50" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="de0885c191c85c35cc50" transform="translate(973814 190362)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(5798 95415.5) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-5798 -95415.5)"><path d="M 0 0 L 11596 190831" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-de0885c191c85c35cc50)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:69.2pt;border-top:0.