:18pt;"><span class="list-marker">•</span><span class="list-tab" aria-hidden="true" data-list-suffix="tab" style="flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;"></span></span>Benefits are unlikely if birth occurs after 7 days.</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Rescue course if treatment &gt;7 days</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="a009704e76acfc9af355564d" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-09-033"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure a009704e76acfc9af355564d" viewbox="733425 -28575 257175 314325" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="9773b068a6ce430509b089791d84262e96cec89e578ee68c55f18f843f23f266"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-73c3d2f53fb007680f44" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="73c3d2f53fb007680f44" transform="translate(860878 22678)"><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M 0 0 L 5443 146957" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-73c3d2f53fb007680f44)"></path></g></g></svg></figure>Likely    :</p><ul style="list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 18pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;"><li data-source-marker-codepoints="U+F0B7" data-source-marker-font="Symbol"><span class="list-prefix" style="display:inline-flex;width:18pt;"><span class