<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19758]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antenatal Education about Labo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19759]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Educate all women regarding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19760]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Latent first stage of labor</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19761]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contact number and details</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19762]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Difference between Braxton Hicks contractions and active labor</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19763]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expected frequency of contractions and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ow long they last.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Water breaking recognition</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19765]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal vaginal loss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Types of birth setting, their pros and cons, she is free to choose her setting.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Record women’s choice regarding birth setting and change can be expected </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>case of any intrapartum problem. She can change her choice whenever she wants.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[19768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pain relief during labo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r.</span></p>', 0);

