<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20095]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Explain procedure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20096]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advice that it will shorten labor by an hour.</span></p>
