<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20102]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Shift to obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> unit by following principles of transfer</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Detailed and full assessment by obstetrician including abdominal examination and consideration of oxytocin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Commen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ce </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>oxytocin infusi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>on if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>agree</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contractions are inadequate</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Follow protocols of oxytocin administrations</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Repeat examination after 4 hours.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Progress &gt; 2cm</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>progress &lt; 2cm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue care</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> review to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>                                                                               </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>assess </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>for C/S</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Normal progress</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>no progress</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em>Confirm Delay</em></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20103]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20104]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue care and support</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20105]"> </p>
