<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20125]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Protocols of Oxytocin Administrations:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20126]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Start after discussion with women, stop whenever she wants.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20127]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ffective analgesia i.e., epidural</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20128]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> led units after obstetrician’s advice</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20129]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20130]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitor fluid balance</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20131]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> I/V fluid routinely except patient is not drinking or dehydrated or hypotensive</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20132]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incremental doses not less than 30 min, till 3 – 4 contractions in 10 minutes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20133]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Stop oxytocin:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20134]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contractions &gt; 4 in 10 minutes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20135]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal CTG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20136]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women’s request.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20137]"> </p>', 0);

