<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20142]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>When baby’s head is visible or involuntary or active pushing with full dilatation of cervix.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20143]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Examination:</strong></span></p>
