<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20145]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Position of head</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20146]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Descent</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20147]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Caput and molding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20148]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FHR – every 5 min for 1 min after contraction abdominal examination – for frequency, strength and duration of contractions.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20149]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Position in 2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>nd</strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> stage:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20150]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>She can opt for position whatever she finds comfortable except lying on her back</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20151]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lying o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> side – choice of spontaneous birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20152]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Upright position and keeping mobile may be beneficial as it reduces FHR abnormalities, episiotomy rate and improve her birthing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
