<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20237]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 1 hour of pushing in primi</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>gravida</span></p>
