<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20240]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment of Mother and baby</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20241]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Progress</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20242]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contractions</span></p>
