<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20254]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Senior review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20255]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(diagnose delay)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20256]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Confirm delay:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20257]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 1 hour of pushing in multi</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20258]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 2 hours of pushing in primi</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20259]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20260]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Escalate senior review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20261]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transfer of care if needed with full protocols</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20262]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer support to women</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20263]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20264]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20265]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In person review by obstetrician including</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20266]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal well being</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20267]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Maternal well being</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20268]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirmation that there are no signs of obstructed labo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20269]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirmation that contractions are infrequent or ineffective</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20270]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20271]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20272]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Start oxytocin after obstetrician’s decision with protocols of oxytocin</span></p>
