<div class="mm-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:134.85pt;"><col style="width:134.85pt;"><col style="width:134.9pt;"><col style="width:134.9pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Condition</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">First-line uterotonic</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Second-line uterotonic</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Drugs to avoid because of potential harm</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Significant aortopathy</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Marfan syndrome and</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Loyes–Dietz with aortic</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">dilatation &gt;40 mm</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Bicuspid aortopathy and</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">aortic dilatation &gt;45 mm</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Previous aortic</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">dissection</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Turner syndrome and</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">aortic size index</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">&gt;25 cm/m2</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Oxytocin</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Misoprostol</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Carboprost</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Ergometrine (because of risk</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">of hypertension-induced</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">aortic dissection or rupture)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Limited or fixed low</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">cardiac output, or</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">preload-dependent</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">circulation</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Severe systemic</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">ventricular dysfunction</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">(ejection fraction &lt;30%)</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Severe valvular stenosis</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Hypertrophic</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">cardiomyopathy with</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">diastolic dysfunction or</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">significant outflow tract</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">obstruction</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Fontan circulation</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Cyanotic heart disease</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Slow infusion of</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">oxytocin to</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">avoid sudden</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">haemodynamic</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">change</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Misoprostol</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Carboprost</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Long-acting oxytocin</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">analogues and ergometrine</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">(because of risk of</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">hypertension-induced heart</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">failure)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Pulmonary arterial</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">hypertension</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Oxytocin</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">misoprostol</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Ergometrine, Carboprost and</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">long-acting oxytocin</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">analogues (because of risk of</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">worsening pulmonary</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">hypertension)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Coronary artery disease</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Oxytocin</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">misoprostol</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Ergometrine (because of risk</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">of coronary ischemia)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20706]"> </p>', 3);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-10-013';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-10-013-0', 't-mm-10-013', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-10-013" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20707]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>ASTHMA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20708]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Pain Relief:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20709]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer all options as in normal healthy women.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20710]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Prostaglandin:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20711]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prostaglandin F</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> alpha – contraindicated </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20712]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cause bronchospasm.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20713]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prostaglandin E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>1</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>2 </sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– safe for IOL</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20714]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>E</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sub>1</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – an option for PPH.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20715]"> </p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-10-014';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-10-014-0', 't-mm-10-014', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-10-014" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20716]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>WOMAN ON LONG TERM SYSTEMIC STEROIDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20717]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Stress Dose Steroids:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20718]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women with adrenal insufficiency </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20719]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Taking long term steroid </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20720]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Prednisolone 5mg daily or more for &gt; 3 months.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20721]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20722]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20723]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue regular oral steroid.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20724]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Give stress steroids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20725]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1. </strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>In Labo</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>u</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>r:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20726]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrocortisone 50mg I/V or I/m</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20727]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Every 6 hours till delivery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20728]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>And 6 hours after birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20729]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2. In planned C/S:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20730]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>100mg Hydrocortisone I/V before induction of anesthesia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20731]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50mg 6 hours after birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20732]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>3. In Emergency C/S:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20733]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50mg hydrocortisone I/V (if women have received 50mg in labor).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20734]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>50mg 6 hours after birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20735]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No need of stress dose in women who are taking topical or inhalational steroids.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20736]"> </p>', 0);

DELETE FROM content_blocks WHERE topic_id = 't-mm-10-015';
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, `order`) VALUES ('cb-book-t-mm-10-015-0', 't-mm-10-015', 'document_html', '<div class="mm-release-marker" data-mm-release="f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605" data-mm-topic="t-mm-10-015" hidden></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20737]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>BLEEDING DISORDERS:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20738]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Analgesia and Anesthesia:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20739]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discuss benefits and risks of regional anesthesia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20740]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Take into accent</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20741]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Overall risk of bleeding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20742]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Availability of corrective treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20743]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. Therapeutic and prophylactic anticoagulation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20744]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. Risk of bleeding with technique used</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20745]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5. Difficulty of needle sitting or insertion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20746]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6. Risk of general anesthesia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20747]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7. Risk of no analgesia or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>non-regional</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> analgesia (comparative risk).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20748]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20749]"> </p>
