<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Table: Modifying the birth plan according to maternal platelet count in women with immune thrombocytopenic purpura or gestational thrombocytopenia:</strong></span></p>
<div class="mm-table-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0"><table class="mm-table" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;"><colgroup><col style="width:269.75pt;"><col style="width:269.75pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="476" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Maternal platelet count</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;background-color:#B4C6E7;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;">Maternal care</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="1019" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Platelet count</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">above 80×109/l</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Treat the woman as healthy for the purpose of considering</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">regional analgesia and anaesthesia</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="1826" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Platelet count 50 to</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">80×109/l</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Before considering regional analgesia and anaesthesia, take into</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">account:</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">• clinical history</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">• the woman''s preferences</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">• Anaesthetic expertise</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="774" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Platelet count</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">below 50×109/l</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:269.75pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Avoid regional analgesia and anaesthesia under most circumstances</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20765]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Birth Plan:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Babies @ risk of bleeding in ITP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Maternal care:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20769]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>platelet count weekly after 36 weeks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20770]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Birth in obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> led unit with high dependency care for neonate.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20771]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>MDT after platelets &lt; 50 including hematologist.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20772]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider giving steroid or immunoglobulins to raise platelet if count is &lt; 50.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20773]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Platelet count @ time of admission.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20774]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Neonatal care:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20775]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Inform neonatal team </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20776]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t do:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20777]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FBS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20778]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ventouse delivery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20779]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Caution doing:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20780]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mid – cavity or rotational Forceps.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20781]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal scalp electrodes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20782]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Measure platelets in umbilical cord blood </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20783]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>C/S may not protect baby form bleeding</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20784]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>3</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>rd</strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> stage of Labor:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20785]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>e</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d risk of primary and secondary hemorrhage </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20786]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Active management of 3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>rd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20787]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid I/M uterotonics</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20788]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Individuali</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>z</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ed postpartum care plan by MDT including hematologist to include</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20789]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Measurement of blood loss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20790]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> complication</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20791]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> hematological parameters.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20792]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid NSAIDS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20793]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before discharge inform women about secondary PPH</span></p>', 0);

