s (AVPU)</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:82.55pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;padding-left:0pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-top:8.6pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:4.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">Hourly</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:106.2pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;padding-left:0pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-top:8.6pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:4.15pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">Hourly</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:91.25pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;padding-left:0pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:4.15pt;padding-right:35.6pt;margin-top:14.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">Every 30 minutes</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:138.15pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;padding-left:0pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-top:8.6pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;padding-left:4.15pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">Hourly</p></td></tr><tr data-mm-row-height-twips="1230" data-mm-row-height-rule="auto"><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:100.65pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;padding-left:0pt;"><p style="margin:0;padding-left:4.1pt;margin-top:14.1pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">Oxygen saturation</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:82.55pt;border-top:0.75pt solid #000000;border-right:0.75pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.75pt solid #000000;border-left:0.75pt solid #000000;padding-right:0pt;