<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contractions – by tocodynamometer</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21195]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Base line FHR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Variability</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Decelerations.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21198]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>1.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>2.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>3.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>4. </strong></span></p>
