<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21211]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21212]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>White</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Amber</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Red</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21213]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21214]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21215]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21216]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21217]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21218]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21219]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Important Consideration while Reviewing CTG:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21220]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evaluate changes on trace over time</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21221]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Document any change from previous review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21222]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Review changes alongside existing or new intrapartum risk factors</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21223]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Think about possible reason for any change and take into account whole clinical picture in formulating ongoing care.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21224]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal CTG trace indicate that baby is coping well with labour</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21225]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Changes to FHR during labour are common and don’t necessarily cause concern, however they may represent fetal compromise.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21226]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If CTG trace changes or is not normal there will be less certainly about the condition of the baby</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21227]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Accelerations:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21228]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Transient    in FHR of 15bpm or more lasting 15 sec or more</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21229]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Presence of accelerations even with reduced variability is reassuring.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21230]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Absence of accelerations on an otherwise normal CTG trace does not indicate fetal acidosis.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21231]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Categorization of CTG traces:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21232]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Normal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21233]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No amber or no red feature</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21234]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>All 4 features are white.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21235]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspicious:</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21236]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Any 1 feature amber</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21237]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pathological</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21238]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Any feature red or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21239]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 or more features are amber.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21240]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Special consideration for CTG traces in 2</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup><strong>nd</strong></sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> stage of labour:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21241]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Interpretation more challenging in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21242]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Keep low threshold for seeking 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> opinion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21243]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Differentiate FHR from MHR every 5 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21244]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider scalp electrode if there is concern</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21245]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>about confusing FHR and MHR.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21246]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Accelerations are most likely to be maternal pulse</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21247]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If there are deceleration, look for other signs of hypoxia like   in baseline FHR or reduction in variability.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21248]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypoxia is more common and more rapid in active 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21249]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FHR &gt; 20bPm from baseline or more from start of labour is labelled as red feature in active.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21250]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG concern in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21251]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21252]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21253]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obtain obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetric</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> review </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21254]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discourage Pushing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21255]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Discontinue oxytocin infusion unless birth is imminent</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21256]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Agree and document CTG trace.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21257]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Management of Abnormal CTG Trace:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21258]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Suspicious CTG:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21259]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>1.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>No other concerning risk Factor:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21260]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21261]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21262]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full assessment of clinical picture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21263]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Under take conservative measures.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21264]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>2.</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Other concerning risk factor like sepsis, meconium, slow progress.</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21265]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21266]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full assessment of clinical picture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21267]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Conservative measures</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21268]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent review by an obstetrician or a senior midwife</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21269]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21270]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal scalp stimulation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21271]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite the birth.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21272]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Pathological CTG:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21273]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent review by an obstetrician or senior midwife.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21274]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Exclude acute events</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21275]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>prolapses</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21276]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abruption</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21277]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rupture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21278]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Full assessment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21279]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Undertake conservative measures</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21280]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21281]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Still pathological after conservative measures</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21283]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21284]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21285]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obtain further urgent review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evaluate whole clinical picture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Document the timing of seeking review and making decision.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21289]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Acute Bradycardia or single Prolonged Deceleration for 3 min or more:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21290]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urgent obstetric review</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21291]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute event – Expedite birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21292]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Underlying causes – undertake conservative measures</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21293]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Make preparations for urgent birth including a request for pediatric or neonatal support</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21294]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>[</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bradycardia</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>]</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21295]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>persists for 9 min or less in women with Risk Factor</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expedite Birth </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21297]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21298]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>[</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Bradycardia</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>]</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21299]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>recovers up to 9 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21300]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reassessment.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21301]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21302]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21303]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21304]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21305]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21306]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>(P – T – O)</span></p>', 0);
