<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21325]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21326]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Underlying causes and conservative Measures</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21327]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop oxytocin</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tocolytics terbutaline 0.25mg S/C.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Left lateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V fluids if women are hypotensive secondary to epidural top – up.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Call an anesthetist</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Maternal Position</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>hypotension</strong></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Excessive Contractions</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Can cause</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21330]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cord compression</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterine blood flow</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21333]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21334]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Encourage to mobilize or </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Adopt an alternate position</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21336]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No facial oxygen therapy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No amnioinfusion.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21339]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Fetal Scalp Stimulation</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21340]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Suspicious CTG with antenatal or intrapartum risk factors for compromise</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21341]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21342]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21343]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Digital scalp stimulation</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- No acceleration </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21344]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acceleration in FHR + improvement</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Expedite birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21346]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21347]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue FHR monitoring</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21348]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Record keeping for CTG:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21349]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Set date and time clock correctly on machine</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21350]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Set paper speed at 1cm/ min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21351]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct labelling with women’s name, DOB, NHS Number, Pulse rate @ start of monitoring and date of CTG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21352]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Save record Electronically or photocopy of CTG trace</span></p>
