<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21558]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Treatment:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21559]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Tocolysis:</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nifedipine</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21560]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider – 24 – 25</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21561]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer – 26 – 33</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21562]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Nifedipine is C/I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, OFFER</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Atosiban</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21563]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>n </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Utero Transfer =&gt; Atosiban</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21564]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>In established or suspected or diagnosed or planned birth</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Steroid</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> for lung maturation:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21565]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>23 – 23</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – discuss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21566]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer – 24 – 33</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21567]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider – 34 – 35</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21568]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt''>In establisher or planned birth within 24 hours</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>M</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>g</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>so4</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong> for neuroprotection:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21569]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>23 – 23</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks discuss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21570]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer – 24 – 29</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21571]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Consider – 30 – 33</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21572]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21573]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21574]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Atosiban when </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>nifedipine</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> is C/I:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21575]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Heart failure</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21576]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Valve disease</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21577]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Acute </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>coronary</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> disease</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21578]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Low B.P</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21579]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Porphyria, Myasthenia gravis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21580]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mg so4 </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>4g I/V over 15 min</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21581]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Followed by</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>g/hr infusion until birth or 24 hours (which</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> so </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ever is sooner)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21582]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Monitoring 4 hourly</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21583]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>HR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21584]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>B.P</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21585]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>R.R</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21586]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tend</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>on</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> reflexes</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21587]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>UOP record</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21588]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If signs of renal failure or olig</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>uri</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21589]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21590]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21591]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More frequent</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21592]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduce dose</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21593]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fetal monitoring</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21594]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CTG</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21595]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intermittent</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21596]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Scalp electrodes</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21597]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 34 weeks don’t offer unless</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21598]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a) No other alternative acceptable</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21599]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>b</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>) Obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is involved</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21600]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>c) CTG not possible by ext</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ernal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> electrode</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21601]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>d) Benefits are </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>more than</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Risks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21602]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- FBS: 34 – 36</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks = discuss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21603]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Before 34 weeks don’t offer</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21604]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>34 – 36</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks – discuss benefits &gt; Risks.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21605]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Fetal monitoring @ 23 – 25</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>+6</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> weeks = involve obs</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>tetrician</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> in decision making how to monitor and whether to monitor or not </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21606]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>MOD </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>– discuss</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21607]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breach @ 26 – 36 + 6 =&gt; LSCS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21608]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Cord Clamping</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> - &gt; 30sec but &lt; 3 min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21609]"> </p>
