<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21692]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Uterine rupture history (5%, 10-fold rupture)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21693]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Non transverse incision</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21694]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Esp </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>classical 200</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> – 900/10,000 rupture</span></p>
