<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21698]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CEFM</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> recommended</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>      should be </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>assessed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21699]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> can be given</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>       by consultant </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>with</span></p>
