<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21704]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Risk of VBAC:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21705]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rupture – 0.5 – 2/10,000 in unscarred uterus</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21706]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Previous I</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> = 22 – 74/10,000</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21707]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Previa II = 1.3%.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21708]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>BT – 1% additional risk</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21709]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Endometritis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 1% additional risk</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21710]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hysterectomy</span></p>
