<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21712]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OASI in VBAC – 5% =&gt; AVB = 39%</span></p>
