<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21720]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TN</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21721]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 – 3% VBAC</span></p>
