<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21745]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Macrosomia, short interval =&gt; more rupture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21746]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>safety data limited.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21747]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21748]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Risks</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> factors</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> for Unsuccessful VBAC:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21749]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. Induced labour</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21750]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. No previous birth</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21751]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. BMI &gt; 30</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21752]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. Previous c/s due to dystocia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21753]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5. Weight &gt; 4kg</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21754]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6. &lt; 4cm @ admission</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21755]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>7. No epidural</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21756]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>8. VBAC @ 41 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21757]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>9. Previous pre – term ISCS</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21758]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>10. &lt; 2 years’ interval</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21759]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>11. Non white </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21760]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>12. Male infants</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21761]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Advance maternal age</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21762]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Short structure.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21763]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>S/S of Rupture:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21764]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Confirmatory triad of rupture in 10%: laparotomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21765]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Augmentation </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ IOL </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>=&gt; with care </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- 2 – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3-fold</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>      risk of rupture (1 – 2%)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1.5-fold</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>      risk of C/S</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21768]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21769]"> </p>
