<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21775]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Rupture:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21776]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>90% in labor peek incidence @ 4 – 5cm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21777]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>18% in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21778]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>8% identified post delivery</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21779]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>14 – 33% require hyste</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>re</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ctomy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21780]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abnormal CTG in 66 – 76% of rupture</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21781]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Scar Thickness:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21782]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0.6 – 2mm – PPV for defect I/</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>p</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21783]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 – 4mm – NPV for defect I/P</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21784]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>EFW:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21785]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt; </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4kg – success of VBAC &lt; 50%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21786]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rupture = 3.6%</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21787]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21788]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21789]"> </p>
