<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Safety</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>criteria</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>for</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Operative</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Vaginal</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Birth</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>(OVB)</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong> </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>met</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 13pt''><u><strong>Decision Making for Assisted Birth:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21987]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><strong>Consider Trial in theater if</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Head 1/5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> palpable abdominally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Head is in mid pelvis</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Rotation required</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Features suspicious of CPD – Short </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>stature</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>OP – position </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>BMI &gt;30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>EFW &gt; 4kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Continue in the labour room if:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Head is low – pelvic/outlet</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No rotation or rotates easily</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No features of CPD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Select optimal place for birth</span></p>
