<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22007]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>If progressive descent not observed with appropriate traction:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check if the instrument is applied correctly</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reassess for features of cephal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>pelvic disproportion</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Seek second opinion may revise approach (change instrument, alter direction of traction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rapid Negative pressure is recommended</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Discontinue procedure if descent not achieved with above measures</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Discontinue vacuum assisted birth if two ‘</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>pop offs’</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><em><strong> </strong></em></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>of the instrument.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>   </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>One POP – Off</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Less experienced</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Expert</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Seek expert opinion</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>reassess</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Number of POP – off</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Neonatal trauma and failed AVB</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>1 - 2 P</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>u</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>lls of forceps</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Minimal descent</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Experienced</strong></em></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>less experienced</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reassess</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>stop:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> seek expert opinion</span></p>
