<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22040]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22041]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22042]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22043]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Factors affecting AVB:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22044]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continuous support    AVB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22045]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural     AVB but less likely with newer techniques</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22046]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Epidural in latent phase don’t    risk</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22047]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Women in labo</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>u</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>r should adapt position to reduce AVB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22048]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Upright, lateral – without epidural</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22049]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lateral – with epidural</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22050]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>To reduce AVB</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22051]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delayed pushing 1 – 2 hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22052]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t discontinue epidural in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22053]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t use synto</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cinon</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> routinely in 2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> stage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22054]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Don’t use manual rotation routinely</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22055]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22056]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22057]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Classification of AVB</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22058]"> </p>
