<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22276]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>14. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt''><strong>MATERNAL COLLAPSE</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22277]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Ensure manual uterine displacement</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Call for help</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Assess breathing, pulse, B.P, FHR</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Regular assessment by MEWS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Identify cause of collapse and direct treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Safe environment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22278]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>YES </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22279]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stimulate &amp; assess response</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22280]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>NO</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22281]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Check obstruction</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Head tilt, chin lift</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Shout for help</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22282]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Airway open</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22283]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Breathing normally</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Turn into recover position</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check help is on the way</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Regular asses MEOWS</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Identify cause of collapse and direct treatment</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Look for chest movement</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Listen for breathing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Feel for air</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22284]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assess for breathing to see </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22285]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No breathing</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Start CPR</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22286]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>Produces 30% of cardiac output</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''> of non – pregnant that i</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>s further reduced by 10% by gravid uterus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22287]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CPR less effective if GA &gt; 20 weeks</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- 30 compressions @ 100</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>-120</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Depress 5 – 6cm @ center of chest</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Ventilations = 2 breaths @ 10/min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Until: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>defibrillator</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>/ monitor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> attached</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22288]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ensure manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt 15 – 30</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>0</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>.</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>obese pts head side position</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> is best</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> for chest compression</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Mouth – mouth if no airway adjunct available</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2 ventilations to minimize interruption to chest compression</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22289]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22290]"> </p>
