<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22292]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22293]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Asystole &amp; PEA</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>VF</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>/ </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Pulses V</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>T</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Attach defibrillator assess rhythm</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22294]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Some setting as non-pregnant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Left pad more lateral</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>In heavier breast ant</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> &amp; post</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>erior</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pads.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Remove uterine monitors</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>shock</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>120-</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>200 J biphasic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>0 J monophasic</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22295]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22296]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediate CPR 30:2 for 2 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22297]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>CPR 30:2 for 2min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22298]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><u><strong>During CPR:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Establish I/V line</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- High flow O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''><sub>2</sub></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- intubate &amp; then continuous chest compression</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Correct reversible cause</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Adrenaline every 3-5min</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>- Consider – Amiodarone, Atropine, Mg.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Antiarrhythmic</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> Drugs:</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 3 DC Shock </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amiodaro</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>st</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>300mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> bolus</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose 150mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>If not available give lidoc</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ai</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ne</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1st dose 1-1.5mg/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>nd</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dose: 0.5-0.75mg/kg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After 5</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>th</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> DC Shock</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Amiodarone 150mg</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22299]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Give Adrenaline 1mg</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> IV</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22300]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> continue CPR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22302]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Correct reversible causes</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22304]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>T</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>s</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22306]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tension pneumothorax</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Tamponade, Cardiac</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22308]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Toxic/ Therapeutic (Local anesthetist)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22309]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombosis, Pulmonary</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22310]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thrombosis, coronary</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22311]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22312]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>5</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22313]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypoxia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22314]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypovolemia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22315]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hypo/hyperkalemia – hyponatremia – oxytocin use</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22316]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hyp</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>o</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>thermia.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22317]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hydrogen ions (acidosis)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22318]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Other Considerations</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22319]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22320]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Empty uterus if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 20weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22321]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Important points regarding CPR;</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22322]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reversible cause – survival </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>is more</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22323]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Non pregnant – </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>laryngeal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> airway or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>supraglottic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> airway are acceptable but not in pregnant it is not suitable due to risk of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> regurgitation,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> mucosal bleeding and further intubation</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> is</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> difficulty due to blood and obscure</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>d</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> view.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22324]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ominal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> USG by expert to look for </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>concealed</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>hemorrhage</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22325]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Vasov</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ag</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>al &amp; epilepsy =&gt; commonest cause of collapse.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22326]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual uterine displacement or left lateral tilt</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22327]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Perimortem C/S</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22328]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>If &gt;20 weeks</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22329]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Aim for uterine evacuation within 5 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22330]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>No response despite correct performance of CPR within 4 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22331]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Achieved within 5 min</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22332]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>69% in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>fan</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>t survival</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22333]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>Hypoxic brain damage of neonate if </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>perimortem</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''> C/S performed after 6min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22334]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22335]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cardiac arrest 50% survival of mother.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22336]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>54% survived until discharge</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22337]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>42% with mod – good Neurological outcomes.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22338]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>More favorable outcome when CPR performed within 10min.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22339]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22340]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22341]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22342]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22343]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22344]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 13pt''><u><strong>Post Collapse management</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22345]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Patient Alive</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>YES</strong></em></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>NO</strong></em></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Continue treatment of underlying</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Inform </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>coroner</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> or prosecutor</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>cause of collapse</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>fiscal inform MBRRACE</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>transfer to appropriate clinical</span><span class="mm-run