r-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Respiratory system:</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">RR</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">O2 consumption</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Residual capacity</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Arterial PCo2</p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;">Laryngeal edema</p></td><td style="white-space:pre-wrap;width:179.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;"><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"></p><p style="margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="31a5bfcc30dfc4b24995c548" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Source figure 31a5bfcc30dfc4b24995c548" viewbox="1371600 -66675 247650 314325" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid meet" data-mm-object-manifest="cb7ea4ebd2dfee989e26830dacf6c90862082e88d513ec3154f96e648d71d2af"><defs><marker id="arrow-end-2149243ff63296e3609f" markerwidth="10" markerheight="7" refx="9" refy="3.5" orient="auto" markerunits="strokeWidth"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z" fill="#000000"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id="2149243ff63296e3609f" transform="translate(1492885 23813)"><g transform="translate(0 0) translate(2381.5 71437.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-2381.5 -71437.5)"><path d="M 0 0 L 4763 142875" fill="none" fill-opacity="0" stroke="#000000" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="12700" marker-end="url(#arrow-end-2149243ff63296e3609f)"></path></g></g></svg></figure></p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;"><figure class="mm-figure" data-mm-figure-id="32bf6cf0dd971fa9b04d949f" data-mm-topic-id="t-mm-10-038"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role