<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22485]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> pack and</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> do the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> dress</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ing of</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> the abd</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>omen</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
