<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22765]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual examination</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22766]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Place of clearance </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22767]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Present then</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> remove in LR</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22768]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>absent</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>then remove in OT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22769]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Or no signs of separation</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22770]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22771]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>OT</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22772]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Manual Removal:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22773]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>inform patient</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22774]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analgesia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22775]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop oxytocin and start terbutaline</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22776]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Empty bladder </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22777]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>5. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Antibiotics</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22778]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Be aware of invasion.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>  </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22779]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Acute Uterine inversion:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22780]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>I/V line + fluids</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22781]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Cross match </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22782]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analgesia</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22783]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Terbutaline </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22784]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Manual reduction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22785]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed =&gt; hydrostatic reduction</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22786]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>failed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22787]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abdominal correction</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Grasp ground</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ligaments.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- Plication after</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>correction.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22788]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incident reporting + debriefing.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22789]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Fluid Therapy</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> in PP</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>H</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22790]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Crystalloid:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22791]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to 2 lit isotonic</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22792]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Colloid:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22793]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>up to 1.5lit until blood arrive</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22794]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>avoid hydroxyl starch</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22795]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Blood:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22796]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Immediate O</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, kell</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><sup>-ve</sup></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22797]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intraoperative cell salvage if available or to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Jehovah’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> witness</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22798]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Switch to group specific</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22799]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>FFP:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22800]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Testing of coagulation available</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22801]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22802]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22803]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>No </strong></em></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Yes</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22804]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+ bleeding continues</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>- </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Normal</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-FFP not </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22805]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>After blood transfusion</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>required, risk of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>TRALI</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22806]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>TACO (Transfusion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22807]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4 units of FFP</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>related circulatory</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22808]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>F/B</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> 12 – 15ml/kg of FFP</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>overload).</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22809]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Till test available.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>-  </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>  Ed PT, APTT </u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>&gt;1.5 </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22810]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>           </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>of </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>normal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>+</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt''>ongoing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22811]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Early institution of FFP</u></span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>haemorrhage.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22812]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in abruption DIC, AF</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>15ml/kg of FFP till PT/</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22813]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>embolism.</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>APTT &lt;1.5 of (N).</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Stop FFP when </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PT/APTT</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> normal or</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22814]"><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>bleeding stops.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22815]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Ongoing Haemorrhage</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong> + Test </strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>n</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>ot Available:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22816]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>8 units of blood: 2 units</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of cryo: 1 pool Plt</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22817]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>6 units of blood: 4 units</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> of FFP.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22818]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>D</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>IC occurs in followings:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22819]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>PE</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22820]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>IUD</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22821]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>AF embolism</span></p>
