<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22980]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22981]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22982]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 13pt''><u><strong>Evaluation:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22983]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>History:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22984]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or buttock pain</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22985]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Severe pain is hallmark, interfere mobility, pain can be perineal </span><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>abdominal</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22986]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Intermittent bleeding </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22987]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Urinary retention or micturition difficulty </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22988]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Difficulty defecations.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22989]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hemodynamic concerns</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22990]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Rule out cause of h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ematoma.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[22991]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Examination:</strong></em></span></p>
