<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23016]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>1. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Analgesia</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>unstable.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23017]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>2. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Local compression</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. Urological </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23018]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>3. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bed rest</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23019]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ice packs</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>4. Neurological </span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>symptoms.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23020]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Failed conservative treatment</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23021]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Under LA</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23022]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incision + Drainage</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23023]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Evacuation of clots</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23024]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ligation of bleeding points</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23025]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assessment of pressure necrosis (complication of h</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>a</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ematoma)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23026]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Selective arterial:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23027]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Embolization:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23028]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Where surgery is not possible</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23029]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Clinical Governance Issues:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23030]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Document </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23031]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Debrief</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23032]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Incident report</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23033]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Risk management team</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23034]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Skills and drills.</span></p>', 0);

