<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23153]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mental Health History:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23154]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Rapo Building:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23155]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>By introductory sentences like pregnancy, delivery and taking care of baby can be difficult in women’s life and </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>it’s</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> common to </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>feel</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> low </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>or </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>upset. Most women are hesitant to speak about their feelings, fears and condition.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23156]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Exploratory Questions:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23157]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Over past month</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23158]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>How are you feeling recently?</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23159]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Feeling down, hopeless, depressed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23160]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Lack of interest</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23161]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Bonding with child</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23162]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Life events like broken relationship</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23163]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>How she is coping.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23164]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Past history of mental illness</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23165]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosis</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23166]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Treatment taken</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23167]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Any self-harm in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>the </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>past</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23168]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Harm to others in</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> the</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> past</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23169]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Family history:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23170]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>FH of psychotic illness </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23171]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diagnosis and treatment taking</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23172]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Social History:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23173]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Drug abuse</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23174]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Smoking</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23175]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Financial issues</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23176]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Contact with GP to know more about social and personal circumstances.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23177]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Personal History:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23178]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>About schooling</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23179]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>About relationships</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23180]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sexual employment </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23181]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Assessment of Red Flag:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23182]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Self-harm:</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Suicide</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23183]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Have you experienced thought that life is hopeless or not worth living?</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23184]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23185]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Positive</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23186]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23187]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ask about any plan she ha</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>ve</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> made </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23188]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>Have you thought about hurting yourself?</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23189]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23190]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Positive</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23191]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Ask about her intentions to act on these plans</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23192]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>When you think you might go through these plans?</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23193]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23194]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##2F5496; font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Positive</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23195]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Check about protection she </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>has</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23196]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em>What has stopped you, acting on these plans?</em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23197]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Harm to others:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23198]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Have you ever thought of hitting your child or partner?</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23199]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Have your ever thought </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>that your</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> baby or partner are reason for your condition and they shouldn’t be with you? </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23200]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Mental State Examination:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23201]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Assess following states and describe as you notice</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23202]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>1.</strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Speech:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23203]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Rate</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: Fast, slow, variable.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23204]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Rhythm:</u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Flowing, disjoined</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23205]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Volume:</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23206]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Tone:</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23207]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Coherency:</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23208]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u>Relevance:</u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23209]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>2. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Mood</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23210]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Subjective mood </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>vibration</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> (awful doctor)</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23211]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Objective mood: low, manic, mixed</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23212]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Affect: min to min change of emotions.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23213]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>3. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Thoughts</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23214]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Delusional thoughts</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23215]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Thought disorder</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23216]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Obsessional thoughts</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23217]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Compulsion</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23218]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anxieties</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23219]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Self-harm</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> and harm to others</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23220]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>4. </strong></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Perceptions:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23221]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hallucinations: Auditory, Visual, Tactile.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23222]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23223]"> </p>', 0);

