<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23297]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23298]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23299]"> </p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23300]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Anxiety irritability</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-tab" aria-hidden="true">	</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>sense of inadequacy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23301]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Hall mark – sense of inadequacy</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23302]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No Suicidal</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> thought</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23303]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>No worthlessness or hopelessness.</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23304]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23305]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Self – limiting </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>in </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>48hours</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23306]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Monitoring</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23307]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reassurance </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23308]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Support.</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23309]"> </p>
