<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23663]"><span class="mm-run" style=''color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: "Calibri Light", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt''>6.7 PSYCHOTROPIC DRUGS AND THEIR EFFECTS ON PREGNANCY AND LACTATION</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23664]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>Anti – depressants:</strong></u></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23665]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>TCA</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> safe in pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: imipramine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>nortriptyline,</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> sertraline</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23666]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><u><strong>SSRI</strong></u></span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>avoid in pregnancy</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>:</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''> Paroxetine</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>, citalopram, Escitalopram</span></p>
