<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23686]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><em><strong>Antipsychotics are:</strong></em></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23687]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Diabetogenic</span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>: </span><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Offer OGTT in pregnancy</span></p>
