<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23727]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Sleep hygiene</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23728]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Avoid caffeine </span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23729]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Reduce bedtime activity</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23730]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Healthy bed timing</span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23731]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''><strong>Medication:</strong></span></p>
<p class="mm-para" data-mm-source-path="word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23732]"><span class="mm-run" style=''font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt''>Promethazine in severe or chronic sleep problem</span></p>', 0);

